// SOTERRA — os DADOS em inglês (05/10). Nomes e descrições das tabelas do JOGO.DATA, por
// tabela → registro → campo; o registro é o caminho que o JOGO.I18n.percorre dá (o id, ou
// 'id/rooms/0'). Só entra na página quando o idioma é 'en' (index.html), logo depois do último
// js/core/data/*.js: ao registrar, o I18n troca os textos do DATA. O JUIZ NÃO LÊ ESTE ARQUIVO.
//
// É para EDITAR À MÃO: uma linha por registro. Regras (docs/IDIOMAS.md): os números são os
// mesmos do português, o glossário é fixo, e `node tools/i18n_falta.js` diz o que falta e o que
// ficou com número diferente depois de um ajuste de equilíbrio.
JOGO.I18n.registra('en', { dados: {
  "elementInfo": {
    "neutro": {"name":"Neutral","description":"The raw matter of the buried world. It loves no one and hates no one: no weather helps it, no weather hurts it."},
    "fogo": {"name":"Fire","description":"The memory of the sun, kept as embers. Eats fast and charges dear. Hates Water, which silences it."},
    "agua": {"name":"Water","description":"Patient, heavy, in no hurry at all. Goes around what it can't break. Hates Fire, which robs it."},
    "terra": {"name":"Earth","description":"Root, stone and stubbornness. Only gives way when someone digs. Hates Air, which carries it off one grain at a time."},
    "ar": {"name":"Air","description":"What was left of the sky after the sky turned to stone. Never where you aimed. Hates Earth, which pins it."}
  },
  "weathers": {
    "calmo": {"name":"Calm","description":"The still air of rooms nobody has opened in a thousand years. Only the dust moves, and lazily at that. No element has the edge here: the room has no opinion on who should die.","flavor":"Silence is not peace. It's just noise waiting its turn."},
    "chuva": {"name":"Rain","description":"The water the Great Lousa trapped up above finds a way and runs down through the cracks all night. The floor turns to mirror, the noise swallows footsteps — and everything that burns starts to hiss.","flavor":"It has rained for a thousand years. No one had the nerve to tell the rain."},
    "estiagem": {"name":"Drought","description":"Heat rises from the floor grates and stays, with nowhere to go. Sweat dries before it runs, the stone cracks with thirst, and every breath costs a sip nobody has. Here the ember is queen.","flavor":"The whole room is an open mouth waiting for someone to say \"water\"."},
    "vendaval": {"name":"Gale","description":"The vents of the buried world all blow at once and the room becomes a tunnel. Ropes whistle, planks slam, and anything with roots feels it's being dug up in gusts.","flavor":"The wind doesn't pass through here: it lives here, and you're the visitor."},
    "tremor": {"name":"Tremor","description":"The Lousa sinks another hand's breadth and the world remembers it's made of stone. The floor beats like a big, slow heart, dust rises in curtains and the air grows too heavy to carry anything light.","flavor":"It's not the stone that trembles. It's you, and the stone agreeing."}
  },
  "classes": {
    "sumo": {"name":"Barbarian","description":"Big frame, worn cloak and a two-handed axe: holds the chokepoint and never leaves it. Taunts, locks, pushes and charges dearly for every tile of the board. Little hurry, plenty of presence.","lore":"When the Lousa came down, the builders sealed the Locks — and someone had to hold the gate from the inside. He held it, with his father's axe and his back against the stone. A thousand years later he still raps the haft on the floor every imaginary morning: as long as the floor answers, the world is still standing."},
    "arqueiro": {"name":"Hunter","description":"Wide-brimmed hat and a double-barreled shotgun. Ranged damage that stacks: each shot leaves a mark on the target, and whoever carries too many marks takes the whole bill at once. Weak up close, deadly from afar.","lore":"It was the hunters who measured the stone ceiling of the Locks and concluded there was still room for one shot between it and the floor. Since then they mark everything that moves: the marks are a ledger, and no Lock has ever seen a hunter forgive a debt."},
    "bruxo": {"name":"Warlock","description":"Medium and long-range areas, curses that work on their own and terrain control. Wipes out whole rooms — as long as it survives the casting time.","lore":"When the sky clotted, some tried to read the Lousa from the inside. Those who came back brought the handwriting of the stone stuck to their hands: now they write in the air what the Lousa wrote on the world, and the air obeys the same way. The pointed hat is school custom: it points at the sky that no longer exists."},
    "espadachim": {"name":"Rogue","description":"Two daggers, speed, invisibility and poison. Lives by picking the moment: enters from the flank, cuts twice and vanishes before the reply. Dies fast if he misses the window.","lore":"There is no night in a world without sky — there is the dark between two lanterns, and that's where he lives. He learned to walk in the gap between lights and to hand back, on the points of two daggers, the same darkness the Lousa gave everyone."},
    "curandeiro": {"name":"Healer","description":"Heals and blesses those who fight. Doesn't hold the line or wreck the terrain: what a Healer does, and no one else does, is keep the party on its feet one more turn.","lore":"Inherited her grandmother's firefly lantern and the house rule: in the buried world, whoever goes out first is whoever stopped caring for others. Had the armor polished pale on purpose — in a dark Lock, whoever falls needs to know where to run. She doesn't plan to go out any time soon."},
    "invocador": {"name":"Shaman","description":"Fills the board with the grimoire open in one hand: summons creatures that tank and bite, sets traps on passage tiles and strengthens those nearby. Fragile alone; never alone.","lore":"Spent his life listening to the mycelium of the Locks tell who died where. One day he answered — and something on the other side found it funny. Now he summons nothing: he just asks leave, and the buried world lends him a piece of itself. Every loan is noted in the grimoire: forgotten debt is the only kind that charges interest."},
    "minotauro": {"name":"Minotaur","description":"Too big to dodge and too stubborn to retreat. Raises a wall where there was no path and puts his own shield in front of whoever is bleeding. Doesn't kill: decides where the other may walk.","lore":"The Minotaur was put to guard the passage because no one else had fit through it. He doesn't count years: he counts the stones he has raised and the ones he still will. He says a labyrinth isn't meant to lose anyone — it's so whoever enters must choose, and choose slowly."}
  },
  "dificuldades": {
    "facil": {"nome":"Easy","resumo":"Weaker monsters and mild weather. Pays less."},
    "normal": {"nome":"Normal","resumo":"The game as it was tuned."},
    "dificil": {"nome":"Hard","resumo":"Tougher monsters and cruel weather. Pays much more."}
  },
  "spells": {
    "trap-neutro-alarme": {"name":"Alarm Stake (shot)","description":"The stake leaps from the floor, pierces the foot of whoever stepped and sounds off: 11–15 Neutral damage and −1 MP for 1 turn.","flavor":"Works more as a warning than a killer. But it warns painfully."},
    "trap-fogo-brasa": {"name":"Ember Trap (shot)","description":"The buried coal wakes: 17–21 Fire in radius 1 and 4–6 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"He buries embers like someone planting. Harvests screams."},
    "trap-fogo-pira": {"name":"Pyre Trap (shot)","description":"A whole pyre folded into one tile: 39–47 Fire in radius 1 and 9–12 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"The tile remembers having been a bonfire. You remembered late."},
    "trap-agua-redemoinho": {"name":"Whirl Trap (shot)","description":"The floor becomes a funnel: 14–18 Water and the unwary is pulled 2 tiles toward the center.","flavor":"Thousand-year-old still water holds one desire: to go down."},
    "trap-agua-sorvedouro": {"name":"Sinkhole Trap (shot)","description":"A drain of the old world opens: 35–42 Water in radius 1 and suction of 3 tiles.","flavor":"Someone, some day, pulled that plug. No one ever put it back."},
    "trap-terra-laco": {"name":"Noose Trap (shot)","description":"Roots close around the ankle: 13–17 Earth and 0 MP for 2 turns.","flavor":"Mycelium doesn't eat fast. It eats calmly, to make it last."},
    "trap-terra-tremor": {"name":"Tremor Trap (shot)","description":"The slab gives way in radius 1: 36–44 Earth and no one leaves the spot for 2 turns.","flavor":"It's not the hole that hurts — it's the shock of the floor having opinions."},
    "trap-ar-rajada": {"name":"Gust Trap (shot)","description":"A stored vent bursts: 13–18 Air and a 3-tile throw.","flavor":"Old air, kept since before the Lousa, and ill-tempered as it should be."},
    "trap-ar-vortice": {"name":"Vortex Trap (shot)","description":"A knot of wind comes undone in radius 1: 38–47 Air and a 4-tile throw.","flavor":"Whoever designed the vents never imagined someone would close them on purpose."},
    "sumo-neutro-1": {"name":"Iron Axe Strike","description":"The axe comes down on the opponent's chest: 28–36 Neutral damage and a 1-tile push. Twice per turn.","flavor":"At the gate you learn early: first move the other out of place, then argue."},
    "sumo-neutro-2": {"name":"War Cry","description":"Strikes the axe haft on the floor and roars: all enemies are forced to attack him for 2 turns, and he gains 42 shield.","flavor":"The Lock floor answers. It's the only answer left."},
    "sumo-neutro-3": {"name":"Bear Grip","description":"Closes the gauntlet on the enemy's throat: 14–20 damage and 0 MP for 1 turn.","flavor":"He doesn't hold to hurt. He holds to talk."},
    "sumo-fogo-5": {"name":"Ember Skin","description":"The skin heats until it cracks: returns 25% of damage taken to the attacker for 2 turns and resists Fire by 15%.","flavor":"Hitting him is touching the stovetop. Everyone touches it once."},
    "sumo-fogo-10": {"name":"Glowing Edge","description":"27–34 Fire on the axe's edge, and the mark keeps burning 6–9 for 2 turns.","flavor":"His axe leaves a signature. In embers."},
    "sumo-fogo-12": {"name":"Ember Burst","description":"Bursts outward when surrounded: 26–32 Fire in radius 1 and everyone 1 tile back.","flavor":"Surrounding him is warming him. No one was told."},
    "sumo-fogo-15": {"name":"Boiling Blood","description":"Boils his own blood: +35 power for 2 turns, at the cost of 6–8 self burn per turn.","flavor":"They say he spits steam when satisfied with the fight."},
    "sumo-fogo-20": {"name":"Volcanic Reprisal","description":"Taunts the whole room, dons 70 shield and returns 50% of everything he takes for 2 turns.","flavor":"The question isn't whether they'll hit. It's how many will still stand after hitting."},
    "sumo-fogo-30": {"name":"Furnace Fury","description":"His whole body becomes a forge and blows: 65–78 Fire in radius 2, 13–17 burn for 3 turns, a 2-tile push — and the whole room goes into drought.","flavor":"That's how he found out, a thousand years ago, that the Heart of the Lock still beat."},
    "sumo-agua-5": {"name":"Tide Edge","description":"28–36 Water with lifesteal and a 1-tile push: hits, drinks and pushes away.","flavor":"The axe comes out wet. The other comes out drier."},
    "sumo-agua-10": {"name":"Slippery Step","description":"Wets the room floor and slides on it: +30 dodge and +1 MP for 2 turns.","flavor":"Three hundred pounds sliding. More elegant than it sounds."},
    "sumo-agua-12": {"name":"Shoulder Wave","description":"A shoulder of water crosses the line: 29–37 with lifesteal on all, and a 2-tile push.","flavor":"The cistern learned to fight by watching through the drain."},
    "sumo-agua-15": {"name":"Blow Drinker","description":"Absorbs whatever comes: 60 shield, regeneration of 14–18 for 2 turns and clears poisons and roots.","flavor":"He doesn't heal. He swallows and digests later."},
    "sumo-agua-20": {"name":"Raw Tide","description":"Spins and releases the tide: 36–44 Water with lifesteal in radius 2 and a 2-tile push on everyone.","flavor":"Half the room backs off. He ends up with more HP than he started."},
    "sumo-agua-30": {"name":"Absolute Undertow","description":"Pulls the whole room 3 tiles into his own body, swallows 62–73 Water with lifesteal and leaves everyone without MP for 1 turn.","flavor":"When the cistern breathes deep, the whole dance goes with it."},
    "sumo-terra-5": {"name":"Stone Hoof","description":"Hardens the shell: 63 shield and +20 lock for 2 turns — running from him gets much pricier.","flavor":"He doesn't get harder. The world just gets softer by comparison."},
    "sumo-terra-10": {"name":"Founding Stomp","description":"Stomps like laying a foundation: 21–28 Earth in radius 1 and 0 MP for 1 turn.","flavor":"His gate is a thousand years old and never needed repair."},
    "sumo-terra-12": {"name":"Human Stake","description":"Plants himself in the ground and calls everyone: taunt for 2 turns, 75 shield and 20% Earth resistance.","flavor":"He was planted there. He'll have to be dug up."},
    "sumo-terra-15": {"name":"Stone Roots","description":"Sends roots under the floor to the chosen spot: 26–33 Earth in radius 1 and 0 MP for 2 turns.","flavor":"The whole room is his. He only lent you the floor to stand on."},
    "sumo-terra-20": {"name":"Living Rampart","description":"Becomes a wall of flesh and stone: 120 shield, 25% Earth resistance and +30 lock for 3 turns.","flavor":"The builders sealed Locks with gates. He skips the gate."},
    "sumo-terra-30": {"name":"Walking Mountain","description":"Takes a step and the room cracks: 54–65 Earth in radius 2, no one moves for 2 turns, all forced to face him for 3 — and tremor dust fills the air.","flavor":"It's not that the mountain learned to walk. It's that he never agreed to stand still."},
    "sumo-ar-5": {"name":"Brute Charge","description":"Slides up to 4 tiles to the target and crashes into him: 28–38 Air damage. The tank's free entrance.","flavor":"Three hundred pounds don't run. They arrive."},
    "sumo-ar-10": {"name":"Brutal Hurl","description":"Grabs by the breastplate and throws: 29–38 Air and 3 tiles of flight (colliding hurts more).","flavor":"He always aims at the nearest obstacle. For economy of movement."},
    "sumo-ar-12": {"name":"Axe Cyclone","description":"Spins in place with the axe extended: 31–40 Air in radius 1 and a 2-tile push on everyone.","flavor":"Whoever was near becomes a spectator. Far away, preferably."},
    "sumo-ar-15": {"name":"Yank and Return","description":"A breath-noose drags the target 4 tiles to him: 34–43 Air and 0 MP for 1 turn. The enemy shooter hates it.","flavor":"He finds it rude to talk from afar."},
    "sumo-ar-20": {"name":"Iron Typhoon","description":"Crosses up to 6 tiles in a straight line of fury: 65–79 Air and a 3-tile throw at the end of the run.","flavor":"The whole corridor hears the whistle before seeing the barbarian."},
    "sumo-ar-30": {"name":"Doomsday Hurl","description":"Grabs, spins three times and lets go: 94–109 Air, 6 tiles of flight and 2 turns unable to stand (0 MP).","flavor":"He trained a thousand years for the throw that would finally land someone against the Lousa."},
    "arqueiro-neutro-1": {"name":"Marked Shot","description":"14–19 Neutral damage and 1 mark on the target (each mark increases all damage it takes by 5%). Twice per turn.","flavor":"The shot isn't the collection. It's just the ledger entry."},
    "arqueiro-neutro-2": {"name":"Doe Step","description":"Slides up to 4 tiles to an empty tile, spending no MP. Distance is the archer's armor.","flavor":"No one saw him run. Everyone saw him already far away."},
    "arqueiro-neutro-3": {"name":"Collect the Debt","description":"Consumes all of the target's marks: 9 damage per mark, plus 6–10 Neutral damage from the shot.","flavor":"No hunter forgives a debt. At most they postpone the due date."},
    "arqueiro-fogo-5": {"name":"Incendiary Charge","description":"14–19 Fire, 4–5 burn for 2 turns and 1 mark.","flavor":"The cartridge is packed with the resin left from the Greenhouse. Smells like late afternoon."},
    "arqueiro-fogo-10": {"name":"Spark Volley","description":"Three shots in a fan: 16–21 Fire in radius 1 and 1 mark on each one hit. Marking the whole group is the plan.","flavor":"Bulk accounting."},
    "arqueiro-fogo-12": {"name":"Hot Iron","description":"19–23 Fire and 1 mark lasting 4 turns — the red tip is slow to cool.","flavor":"Brands cattle, brands enemies. Same technique; same patience."},
    "arqueiro-fogo-15": {"name":"Detonate Embers","description":"Lights all the marks in radius 1: 12 damage per mark on each target, plus 17–23 Fire in the area.","flavor":"He lights the whole ledger at once. Faster than adding up."},
    "arqueiro-fogo-20": {"name":"Ember Rain","description":"Dozens of glowing pellets fall in radius 2: 34–41 Fire, 9–12 burn for 2 turns and 1 mark on all.","flavor":"Fire rains in a world that hasn't seen rain in a thousand years. Dubious poetic justice."},
    "arqueiro-fogo-30": {"name":"Dead Sun Bandolier","description":"Empties the whole bandolier in radius 2: 39–47 Fire, 20 damage per accumulated mark on each target and 10–13 burn for 3 turns.","flavor":"He kept one cartridge from when there was still a sun. Kept it until now."},
    "arqueiro-agua-5": {"name":"Harpoon Shot","description":"14–19 Water with lifesteal, pulls 2 tiles and leaves 1 mark. Repositions the target where it suits.","flavor":"The rope is thin. The will on the other end is what's thick."},
    "arqueiro-agua-10": {"name":"Springhead Shot","description":"19–24 Water with lifesteal and 1 mark: each shot returns breath to the shooter.","flavor":"Drinks from a distance. The only way an archer drinks."},
    "arqueiro-agua-12": {"name":"Current Line","description":"A current crosses the line: 20–25 Water, a 2-tile push and 1 mark on each target in the row.","flavor":"He aims at the corridor, not at who's in it."},
    "arqueiro-agua-15": {"name":"Detonate the Tide","description":"Bursts the target's marks into water: 14 per mark, plus 23–29 with lifesteal. Collecting the debt heals.","flavor":"The debt becomes a drink."},
    "arqueiro-agua-20": {"name":"Cold Rain","description":"A cloud of icy lead in radius 2: 36–44 with lifesteal, pulls 2 tiles and marks everyone hit.","flavor":"Herds the flock before collecting. Always more efficient."},
    "arqueiro-agua-30": {"name":"Marked Tide","description":"The tide obeys the rope: pulls everything in radius 3 by 3 tiles, deals 41–49 Water with lifesteal and detonates marks at 18 per stack.","flavor":"He pointed at the cistern and said \"come\". Everything came, the water included."},
    "arqueiro-terra-5": {"name":"Flint Lead","description":"18–22 Earth and 1 mark lasting 4 turns: the stone stays lodged long after the shot.","flavor":"Flint chipped by hand, as was done before the sky became a ceiling."},
    "arqueiro-terra-10": {"name":"Stake in the Foot","description":"Pins the target to the ground: 17–21 Earth, 0 MP for 1 turn and 1 mark.","flavor":"Hunter's rule: a target that can't move can't dodge the bill."},
    "arqueiro-terra-12": {"name":"Piercing Shot","description":"The bullet crosses the whole row: 23–29 Earth and 1 mark on every body along the way.","flavor":"Two-hand-span barrel, dry-root stock. Doesn't ask permission."},
    "arqueiro-terra-15": {"name":"Detonate the Boulder","description":"The marks turn to stone and collapse: 13 per mark, 21–27 Earth and 0 MP for 2 turns.","flavor":"Collecting a debt with a boulder is rude. It's also final."},
    "arqueiro-terra-20": {"name":"Menhir Volley","description":"Menhirs the size of posts fall in radius 2: 34–42 Earth, 0 MP for 2 turns and 1 mark on all.","flavor":"No one understands how he carries these things in the bandolier. No one asks."},
    "arqueiro-terra-30": {"name":"Menhir Bullet","description":"A whole column hurled in a straight line: 62–73 Earth across the entire row, 22 per detonated mark and 3 turns without MP.","flavor":"The builders planted menhirs to hold up the world. He found another use."},
    "arqueiro-ar-5": {"name":"Wind Charge","description":"Cheap and fast: 13–17 Air and 1 mark for just 2 AP. The most efficient way to fill the target with marks.","flavor":"No metal tip: just compressed air and ill intent."},
    "arqueiro-ar-10": {"name":"Leaping Shot","description":"20–24 Air that leaps to 2 more nearby enemies (−30% per leap) and marks the first target.","flavor":"The lead ricochets off the stone ceiling. The ceiling, at least, is good for that."},
    "arqueiro-ar-12": {"name":"Spinning Lead","description":"23–29 Air, a 2-tile push and 1 mark: keeps melee always one step away.","flavor":"Spins so much it whistles. The whistle alone is a foot of recoil."},
    "arqueiro-ar-15": {"name":"Detonate the Current","description":"Detonates the marks (12 per stack) and the discharge leaps to 3 more enemies, losing 25% per leap.","flavor":"One's bill becomes everyone's news."},
    "arqueiro-ar-20": {"name":"Lead Gale","description":"A lead gale in radius 2: 39–48 Air, a 3-tile throw and 1 mark on each target.","flavor":"Half the lead misses on purpose, just to make wind."},
    "arqueiro-ar-30": {"name":"Marked Storm","description":"Detonates marks at 20 per stack and releases a 33–41 discharge that leaps through up to 5 enemies (−20% per leap). The room's air becomes a gale.","flavor":"He let go of the rope and the whole Lock came to owe something."},
    "bruxo-neutro-1": {"name":"Arcane Auger","description":"A clean hole of raw energy: 17–22 Neutral damage at up to 5 tiles. Twice per turn.","flavor":"The school's first lesson: the world has holes. Make more."},
    "bruxo-neutro-2": {"name":"Whispered Plague","description":"Curse in radius 1: 7–9 damage per turn for 2 turns and −15 power on the cursed.","flavor":"He never shouts the plague. The stone is deaf enough already."},
    "bruxo-neutro-3": {"name":"Lead Circle","description":"Draws a heavy circle on the floor: 5–8 damage and −2 MP for 1 turn in radius 1.","flavor":"Lead is the favorite metal of those who like things to stay put."},
    "bruxo-fogo-5": {"name":"Twin Spark","description":"17–22 Fire and 3–5 burn for 2 turns. The basic that never leaves the notebook.","flavor":"Two sparks: one to hit, one to remember."},
    "bruxo-fogo-10": {"name":"Ash Cone","description":"A fan of hot ash: 26–32 Fire in a cone and 6–9 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"Ash is fire with memory."},
    "bruxo-fogo-12": {"name":"Lesser Meteor","description":"Rips a piece off the stone ceiling and drops it lit: 33–41 Fire in radius 1.","flavor":"The Lousa returns what it lends. With interest and temperature."},
    "bruxo-fogo-15": {"name":"Forbidden Brazier","description":"Lights the floor in radius 2: 12–14 at once and 10–13 per turn for 3 turns. An area that pays off with patience.","flavor":"Written on the school door: \"no kindling braziers indoors\". The whole world is indoors."},
    "bruxo-fogo-20": {"name":"Bent Pyre","description":"Two pyres in the same area: 27–33 Fire in radius 2 and 7–10 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"Folding a pyre is easy. Unfolding it afterward is the hard part."},
    "bruxo-fogo-30": {"name":"Ember Lock Meteor","description":"Brings down a whole piece of the Lousa in flames: 40–48 Fire in radius 3, 11–14 burn for 3 turns and the room goes into drought.","flavor":"He read the stone to the end. On the last page was an instruction: \"pull here\"."},
    "bruxo-agua-5": {"name":"Water Lance","description":"17–22 Water with lifesteal: the warlock drinks half of what he pours.","flavor":"Cistern water, seasoned with a thousand years of bad company."},
    "bruxo-agua-10": {"name":"Siphon","description":"Pulls the target 3 tiles, deals 26–33 Water and dissolves its shield entirely.","flavor":"A shield is just a dry thing that hasn't been wet yet."},
    "bruxo-agua-12": {"name":"Tidal Wave","description":"A wave runs the line: 33–42 Water and a 3-tile push on the whole row.","flavor":"Clears the corridor. Literally."},
    "bruxo-agua-15": {"name":"Hungry Puddle","description":"Opens a hungry puddle in radius 2: 18–23 Water with lifesteal and everyone pulled 2 tiles to the center.","flavor":"It's not deep. Just insistent."},
    "bruxo-agua-20": {"name":"Dissolution","description":"Dissolves all shields in radius 2, deals 30–37 Water with lifesteal and leaves 7–10 per turn for 2 turns.","flavor":"The cistern never broke an armor. It just waited."},
    "bruxo-agua-30": {"name":"The Cistern Remembers","description":"Calls back the water that drowned the court: dissolves shields, pulls 3 tiles, deals 41–50 with lifesteal in radius 3 and makes it rain in the room.","flavor":"He only asked where the cistern's owners were. It answered by showing."},
    "bruxo-terra-5": {"name":"Slab Spike","description":"A slab splinter rises from the floor under the target's feet: 19–24 Earth.","flavor":"The Lock floor cooperates. It always did; no one had asked."},
    "bruxo-terra-10": {"name":"Root Shackle","description":"Roots close around the target's ankle: 0 MP for 2 turns and 20–26 Earth.","flavor":"The Greenhouse sends regards through the underground."},
    "bruxo-terra-12": {"name":"Rift","description":"Splits the floor in a straight line: 35–44 Earth and 0 MP for 1 turn on all who stand in it.","flavor":"Then it closes. Almost always."},
    "bruxo-terra-15": {"name":"Stake Field","description":"Fills the area with stone stakes: 19–23 Earth in radius 2 and 5–8 per turn for 3 turns to whoever stays.","flavor":"The area stays put. Common sense is usually the first to leave."},
    "bruxo-terra-20": {"name":"Menhir Ring","description":"A ring of stones rises 2 tiles from the center: 32–38 Earth and 0 MP for 2 turns on whoever is in the ring.","flavor":"Whoever designed the stone circles didn't design them for standing inside."},
    "bruxo-terra-30": {"name":"The Lousa Descends","description":"Calls a hand's breadth of stone sky down: 47–56 Earth in radius 3, 3 turns without MP and the whole room in tremor.","flavor":"It's the school's most forbidden spell: it replays, in miniature, the day everything ended."},
    "bruxo-ar-5": {"name":"Snap","description":"A dry snap of pressure: 14–19 Air for only 2 AP, up to 6 tiles away.","flavor":"Snaps his fingers. The air across the room snaps with him."},
    "bruxo-ar-10": {"name":"Bouncing Spark","description":"29–36 Air that leaps to 2 more nearby enemies, losing 30% of force per leap.","flavor":"She looks for company. Always finds it."},
    "bruxo-ar-12": {"name":"Warlock Step","description":"Teleports to an empty tile up to 5 away. The fragile mage needs an exit.","flavor":"It isn't elegant magic. It's the magic of someone who doesn't want to get beaten."},
    "bruxo-ar-15": {"name":"Gale Cone","description":"A fan of compressed wind: 23–29 Air and a 3-tile throw on everything in the cone.","flavor":"The Lock's vents groan when he does this. He finds it beautiful."},
    "bruxo-ar-20": {"name":"Thunderstorm","description":"32–39 Air that runs through up to 5 bodies (4 leaps), losing 25% per leap. The whole room in one gesture.","flavor":"There was never thunder under the Lousa. He thinks it's missed."},
    "bruxo-ar-30": {"name":"Eye of the Storm","description":"Opens a storm's eye in radius 3: 41–50 Air, a 4-tile throw, discharges of 21–27 leaping through 4 more bodies — and gale in the room.","flavor":"No one under the Lousa had seen a storm. Now everyone has seen one. Just one."},
    "espadachim-neutro-1": {"name":"Quick Thrust","description":"21–28 Neutral damage for 2 AP, twice per turn. Cheap, fast, no drama.","flavor":"The blade slips through the gap between armor and distraction."},
    "espadachim-neutro-2": {"name":"Short Shadow","description":"Vanishes between two lanterns: invisible for 2 full turns and +20 dodge for 2.","flavor":"In a world without sky, shadow is the only place with room to spare."},
    "espadachim-neutro-3": {"name":"Sidestep","description":"Slides up to 4 tiles without spending MP — usually behind someone.","flavor":"He doesn't circle the enemy. The enemy just ends up facing the wrong way."},
    "espadachim-fogo-5": {"name":"Ember Blade","description":"31–39 fire and 7–11 burn for 2 turns. Twice per turn.","flavor":"The blade turns red on its own since he started sleeping with it."},
    "espadachim-fogo-10": {"name":"Double Burning Cut","description":"Two cuts in an X: 50–62 fire and 8–13 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"The second cut is only so the first doesn't cool."},
    "espadachim-fogo-12": {"name":"Veins Aflame","description":"Heats your own blood: +40 power for 2 turns, at the cost of 8–11 self-burn per turn.","flavor":"Old bet: it hurts now, kills first."},
    "espadachim-fogo-15": {"name":"Spark Dance","description":"Spins with both blades lit: 42–53 fire in radius 1 and 11–15 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"Whoever surrounded him pays the show's admission."},
    "espadachim-fogo-20": {"name":"Scalding Thrust","description":"The blade goes white-hot: 78–92 fire and 17–22 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"Cauterizes on the way back. Almost a favor."},
    "espadachim-fogo-30": {"name":"Seven Flame Cuts","description":"Seven cuts in one breath: dissolves the target's shield, 106–124 fire and 23–30 burn for 3 turns.","flavor":"They say the seventh cut lands after the target has already fallen. On a whim."},
    "espadachim-agua-5": {"name":"Thirsty Blade","description":"31–39 water with lifesteal, twice per turn: the assassin who pays his own way.","flavor":"The blade isn't wet. It's thirsty."},
    "espadachim-agua-10": {"name":"Salt Mist","description":"Vanishes in a salt mist for 2 turns and washes poisons and roots off the body.","flavor":"Salt heals, salt hides, salt preserves. He uses all three senses."},
    "espadachim-agua-12": {"name":"Current Cut","description":"39–49 water at up to 2 tiles and 2 push: cuts and shoves away before the reply.","flavor":"He cuts on the way in and the current does the rest of the work."},
    "espadachim-agua-15": {"name":"Mud Step","description":"Slides up to 5 tiles across any wet surface, without spending MP.","flavor":"Learned it from the drownlings. Just skipped the sinking part."},
    "espadachim-agua-20": {"name":"Leech","description":"73–87 water with lifesteal and 14–20 poison for 2 turns. A strike that pays its own bill.","flavor":"It's not cruelty. It's logistics."},
    "espadachim-agua-30": {"name":"Drown in Blood","description":"103–122 water with lifesteal — half returns as health —, 16–21 poison for 3 turns and 1 turn without MP.","flavor":"The Drowned Court applauded. First time in a thousand years someone danced properly."},
    "espadachim-terra-5": {"name":"Rusty Blade","description":"25–32 earth and 7–12 infection for 3 turns. The swordsman's poison is patient.","flavor":"He doesn't sharpen the blade. Just leaves it dirty enough."},
    "espadachim-terra-10": {"name":"Ankle Cut","description":"31–38 earth and 0 MP for 2 turns: whoever can't walk can't escape the next blow.","flavor":"Knife rule: take away the escape first, then the rest."},
    "espadachim-terra-12": {"name":"Bark Skin","description":"Covers himself in dry bark: 70 shield and 20% earth resistance for 2 turns. The assassin also has to survive the counterattack.","flavor":"Bark from a tree that died the day of the Lousa and never agreed to rot."},
    "espadachim-terra-15": {"name":"Flint Dagger","description":"58–70 earth and 10–15 infection for 3 turns. The splinter stays inside.","flavor":"Chipped stone neither rusts nor forgives."},
    "espadachim-terra-20": {"name":"Buried Ambush","description":"Buries himself in the dust and waits: invisible for 2 turns, +45 power and +20 lock. The next strike is a different strike.","flavor":"Patience is a weapon that makes no noise when drawn."},
    "espadachim-terra-30": {"name":"Menhir Thrust","description":"Plants the blade like raising a menhir: 99–118 earth, 3 turns without MP and 14–19 infection per turn.","flavor":"Stays standing out of politeness. The body already understood it's over."},
    "espadachim-ar-5": {"name":"Wind Cut","description":"26–35 air at up to 2 tiles for 2 AP, twice per turn. Cuts before touching.","flavor":"The cut arrives half a step before the blade. Nobody can explain it; neither can he."},
    "espadachim-ar-10": {"name":"Wind Step","description":"Teleports to any empty tile up to 6 away. Entrance, exit, or both.","flavor":"The air of the Ember Lock owes him some old favor."},
    "espadachim-ar-12": {"name":"Stolen Breath","description":"+2 MP and +25 dodge for 2 turns: crosses the room and escapes any lock.","flavor":"Steals breath from the vents. Returns it as trouble."},
    "espadachim-ar-15": {"name":"Chain Cut","description":"56–70 air that leaps to 3 more nearby enemies, losing 25% each jump.","flavor":"One cut. The repetition is the wind's problem."},
    "espadachim-ar-20": {"name":"Shadow Swap","description":"Swaps places with any unit and cuts on arrival: 53–66 air. Rescues an ally or delivers an enemy.","flavor":"He thinks the board is always slightly wrong."},
    "espadachim-ar-30": {"name":"Thousand Wind Cuts","description":"89–106 air that travels through up to 6 bodies (5 jumps, only −15% each) and pushes all of them 2 tiles.","flavor":"He draws once. The sound arrives later, from several parts of the room."},
    "curandeiro-neutro-1": {"name":"Laying on of Hands","description":"Heals 21–26 HP of an ally (or herself), twice per turn.","flavor":"She spits on her hand first. Says it helps. Nobody dares disagree."},
    "curandeiro-neutro-2": {"name":"Stubborn Sword","description":"18–23 neutral damage. The paladin attacks too — and the sword weighs like duty.","flavor":"It was her grandmother's. Grandmother hit people with it too."},
    "curandeiro-neutro-3": {"name":"Brief Blessing","description":"+20 power on an ally for 2 turns. Short — and makes a huge difference.","flavor":"Raises the shield before the Barbarian's every charge. He waits, out of respect."},
    "curandeiro-fogo-5": {"name":"Scalding Compress","description":"Heals 20–24 and grants 15% fire resistance for 2 turns. It burns, but it closes.","flavor":"\"This will sting a little.\" It always stings a lot."},
    "curandeiro-fogo-10": {"name":"Healing Ember","description":"19–24 fire on an enemy, and half returns to her as HP. Healing by attacking is the way of fire.","flavor":"Grandma called this \"recycling\"."},
    "curandeiro-fogo-12": {"name":"Forge Breath","description":"+35 power and 11–14 regeneration for 2 turns on an ally. Lights up one who was already hot.","flavor":"She blows on the ally the way you blow on forge embers. Works the same."},
    "curandeiro-fogo-15": {"name":"Ash Ring","description":"Slams the shield on the ground and releases a ring of ashes: 26–33 fire in radius 1 and 6–9 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"Pale armor, and a noise that reaches the ceiling."},
    "curandeiro-fogo-20": {"name":"Ember Heart","description":"Heals 53–65 and gives +30 power for 2 turns to all allies in radius 2.","flavor":"She lends her own heart of embers. Repaid in victory."},
    "curandeiro-fogo-30": {"name":"The Caring Flame","description":"Heals 88–104 in radius 2, regenerates 25–32 for 3 turns, gives +45 power and clears poisons and roots from all allies.","flavor":"Grandma's lantern had a single firefly. She figured out how to light the whole room with it."},
    "curandeiro-agua-5": {"name":"Good Drop","description":"Heals 24–29 at up to 6 tiles, twice per turn. The most efficient heal in the game.","flavor":"One drop. She promises it's just one drop."},
    "curandeiro-agua-10": {"name":"Serene Spring","description":"14–19 regeneration for 3 turns and clears all of the ally's poisons.","flavor":"She touches the gauntlet to the floor and water comes out. Never explained."},
    "curandeiro-agua-12": {"name":"Tide Pull","description":"Pulls any unit 3 tiles: rescues the wounded ally or yanks the enemy out of his line of fire.","flavor":"\"Come here.\" And it does."},
    "curandeiro-agua-15": {"name":"Good Wave","description":"Heals 48–58 on all allies in radius 2.","flavor":"The rising tide lifts all boats, even the leaky ones."},
    "curandeiro-agua-20": {"name":"Healing Current","description":"Heals 59–69 immediately and another 14–19 per turn for 2 turns. The \"don't die\" button.","flavor":"Running water gathers no dust. Nor mourning."},
    "curandeiro-agua-30": {"name":"The Good Cistern","description":"Heals 88–104 in radius 3, regenerates 27–36 for 3 turns, clears poisons and roots — and makes it rain inside the Ember Lock.","flavor":"There's a cistern that killed an entire court. She borrowed the same water, with better manners."},
    "curandeiro-terra-5": {"name":"Friendly Bark","description":"32 shield on an ally for 2 turns, twice per turn. Shield is healing that arrives first.","flavor":"She asks the dead tree's leave and the tree lends its bark."},
    "curandeiro-terra-10": {"name":"Clay Poultice","description":"Heals 28–33 and gives 20% earth resistance for 2 turns.","flavor":"Clay from the deep flowerbed. Smells bad, heals well."},
    "curandeiro-terra-12": {"name":"Zealous Root","description":"Roots hold whoever is bothering you: 0 MP for 2 turns and 17–22 earth in radius 1.","flavor":"\"Stay put, I'll be right back.\" Nobody stays put willingly."},
    "curandeiro-terra-15": {"name":"Root Dome","description":"78 shield and 12–17 regeneration for 2 turns on all allies in radius 2.","flavor":"A portable greenhouse, thrown together with what was in the pocket."},
    "curandeiro-terra-20": {"name":"Haven Stone","description":"Heals 58–69, grants 75 shield for 2 turns and tears off the roots holding the ally.","flavor":"She arrives, pushes the stone, and the world stops slipping for a moment."},
    "curandeiro-terra-30": {"name":"Closed Garden","description":"Closes an entire garden around the group: heals 84–100, 176 shield, 25% earth resistance and 22–27 regeneration for 3 turns, in radius 3.","flavor":"That's how the builders made the Locks. She only copied the idea, pocket-sized."},
    "curandeiro-ar-5": {"name":"Sweet Breath","description":"Heals 15–20 for just 2 AP, twice per turn. Heals little, heals always, leaves AP to spare.","flavor":"Blows on the wound. Scientifically indefensible; works."},
    "curandeiro-ar-10": {"name":"Borrowed Breath","description":"+2 MP for 1 turn and +20 initiative for 2 on an ally: ranges that never existed now exist.","flavor":"Keeps sighs in a little vial. Says they're from people who didn't need them anymore."},
    "curandeiro-ar-12": {"name":"Swap Places","description":"Swaps position with any unit up to 6 tiles away. Pulls the ally out of the siege — and takes his place.","flavor":"Never one to flee. Just to swap places with whoever needed it more."},
    "curandeiro-ar-15": {"name":"Friendly Gust","description":"A fan-shaped breath: 33–41 air and 3 tiles of push. Clears space around whoever is falling.","flavor":"\"Excuse me!\" — and half the room backs off."},
    "curandeiro-ar-20": {"name":"Restoring Breeze","description":"Heals 51–61 and gives +1 MP for 2 turns to all allies in radius 2.","flavor":"Heals on the move. The whole group learns to walk together."},
    "curandeiro-ar-30": {"name":"Breath of the Lock","description":"Opens every vent in the room: heals 84–100 in radius 3, +2 MP and +40 initiative for 3 turns, and clears poisons and roots.","flavor":"For three turns, the whole Ember Lock breathes at her rhythm. Then goes back to suffocating, as always."},
    "invocador-neutro-1": {"name":"Lesser Call","description":"Summons a Familiar on an empty tile: one more body to bite, tank and block passage.","flavor":"He never says the beast's name. Says a name is a commitment."},
    "invocador-neutro-2": {"name":"Word of the Pact","description":"13–18 neutral damage at up to 5 tiles. He attacks too, when the flock is busy.","flavor":"The page was written by someone who also called things. Nobody knows with what."},
    "invocador-neutro-3": {"name":"Alarm Stake","description":"Arms a stake on the chosen tile for 3 rounds: whoever steps on it takes 11–15 damage and loses 1 MP.","flavor":"The buried world is full of corridors. A corridor is a place for traps."},
    "invocador-fogo-5": {"name":"Ember Trap","description":"Buries live coal for 3 rounds: whoever steps on it suffers 17–21 fire in radius 1 and burns for 2 turns.","flavor":"Plants embers in rows, like sowing onions."},
    "invocador-fogo-10": {"name":"Ember Hound","description":"Summons an Ember Hound: fast, hot bite and explodes on death. Works as well alive as dead.","flavor":"Wags its tail. The tail lights the floor."},
    "invocador-fogo-12": {"name":"Burning Pact","description":"+35 power and 15% fire resistance for 2 turns — works on allies and on your own creatures.","flavor":"A pact isn't kindness. It's a contract with a performance clause."},
    "invocador-fogo-15": {"name":"Breath of the Pact","description":"Something blows from the other side of the pact: 24–30 fire in radius 1 and 6–8 burn for 2 turns.","flavor":"The breath always comes from the same direction. Nobody wants to know which."},
    "invocador-fogo-20": {"name":"Pyre Trap","description":"Folds a whole pyre into one tile for 3 rounds: 39–47 fire in radius 1 and 9–12 burn on whoever steps in.","flavor":"He tells allies where not to walk. Once. Quietly."},
    "invocador-fogo-30": {"name":"Magma Colossus","description":"Opens the ground and calls a Magma Colossus to the field — and its heat puts the whole room in drought.","flavor":"The Heart of the Ember Lock has an older brother. Nobody's invited him since the Lousa."},
    "invocador-agua-5": {"name":"Whirl Trap","description":"Opens a water funnel for 3 rounds: 14–18 damage and 2 tiles of suction on whoever steps in.","flavor":"A drain with opinions about where people should walk."},
    "invocador-agua-10": {"name":"Tide Nymph","description":"Summons a Tide Nymph: heals allies on her own while the summoner handles the rest.","flavor":"She never speaks. Just looks at whoever is bleeding and handles it."},
    "invocador-agua-12": {"name":"Pact of the Spring","description":"10–13 regeneration for 3 turns and clears poisons on an ally or a summoned creature.","flavor":"Signed in water. The kind of contract you can drink afterward."},
    "invocador-agua-15": {"name":"Call of the Undertow","description":"23–29 water with lifesteal in radius 1 and 2 tiles of suction: drags the enemy into the middle of the flock.","flavor":"Calls the undertow the way you call a big dog: carefully."},
    "invocador-agua-20": {"name":"Sinkhole Trap","description":"An old-world drain, armed for 3 rounds: 35–42 water in radius 1 and 3 tiles of suction.","flavor":"He uncapped something the builders had capped on purpose."},
    "invocador-agua-30": {"name":"Drowned of the Cistern","description":"Opens the lid and lets what was below rise — and the rain comes with it.","flavor":"The cistern returns what it swallowed. Never one at a time."},
    "invocador-terra-5": {"name":"Noose Trap","description":"Hides a root noose for 3 rounds: 13–17 earth and 0 MP for 2 turns on whoever steps in.","flavor":"The mycelium loves a request like that. Does it for free."},
    "invocador-terra-10": {"name":"Stone Sentinel","description":"Summons a Stone Sentinel: slow, hard and stubborn — the summoner's corridor plug.","flavor":"Stays where it's put. The most reliable thing in the buried world."},
    "invocador-terra-12": {"name":"Bark Pact","description":"41 shield and 20% earth resistance for 2 turns on an ally or a summoned creature.","flavor":"Bark borrowed from the Ember Lock's own wall. The wall didn't complain."},
    "invocador-terra-15": {"name":"Stakes of the Pact","description":"Stakes rise from the ground in radius 1: 23–29 earth and 0 MP for 2 turns. Prepares the tile for the next trap.","flavor":"First it holds, then it arms, then it waits. Always in that order."},
    "invocador-terra-20": {"name":"Tremor Trap","description":"Weakens the slab for 3 rounds: whoever steps on it suffers 36–44 earth in radius 1 and spends 2 turns without MP.","flavor":"The Trembling Mine taught: not every floor has to keep being a floor."},
    "invocador-terra-30": {"name":"Mountain Golem","description":"Raises a Mountain Golem: the toughest creature the buried world can lend. A second tank, free, every turn.","flavor":"He didn't summon the mountain. Just asked if it was up for a few steps."},
    "invocador-ar-5": {"name":"Gust Trap","description":"Caps a vent for 3 rounds: whoever steps on it takes 13–18 air and flies 3 tiles.","flavor":"Old air, kept in anger. Worth a kick."},
    "invocador-ar-10": {"name":"Storm Falcon","description":"Summons a Storm Falcon: lots of MP, high initiative and a beak that pushes. Arrives before everyone.","flavor":"There's no sky for it to fly in. Flies anyway, out of spite."},
    "invocador-ar-12": {"name":"Pact of the Wind","description":"+2 MP and +25 initiative for 2 turns on an ally or creature: the whole flock arrives earlier.","flavor":"Short contract, signed in the air, no witnesses."},
    "invocador-ar-15": {"name":"Cutting Breath","description":"A sharp fan of wind: 28–35 air and 3 tiles of push — straight onto the traps.","flavor":"He doesn't push far away. He pushes to where it's already armed."},
    "invocador-ar-20": {"name":"Vortex Trap","description":"Ties a knot of wind on the tile for 3 rounds: 38–47 air in radius 1 and 4 tiles of throw on whoever steps in.","flavor":"Untying is easy: just step on it. Always easy, from the wrong side."},
    "invocador-ar-30": {"name":"Eye of the Tempest","description":"Plants the still center of the storm on the field, and the gale settles in around it.","flavor":"In the middle of the storm there's a still place. That's where he lives."},
    "minotauro-neutro-1": {"name":"Headbutt","description":"Lowers the head and shoves: 16–22 neutral damage and 1 tile of push.","flavor":"He doesn't chase. He decides where you won't pass."},
    "minotauro-neutro-2": {"name":"Shoulder Shield","description":"Puts his own shield in front of an ally: 80 shield for 2 turns.","flavor":"The shield is his. The life he guards is yours."},
    "minotauro-neutro-3": {"name":"First Stone","description":"Raises a wall on an empty tile for 2 turns — blocks passage and sight. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"It's not to protect anyone. It's so the other has to go around."},
    "minotauro-fogo-5": {"name":"Ember Wall","description":"2-turn wall that leaves an armed ember at its foot: whoever steps on it burns. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"The stone cools. The ember beneath it doesn't."},
    "minotauro-fogo-10": {"name":"Boiling Hide","description":"110 shield and reflects 25% of damage taken for 2 turns.","flavor":"Hit him and your hand comes back hurting."},
    "minotauro-fogo-12": {"name":"Blazing Gore","description":"25–33 fire in a fan ahead and 1 tile of push on everyone.","flavor":"He doesn't chase. He makes room."},
    "minotauro-fogo-15": {"name":"Fire Fence","description":"Raises a line of 3 walls and burns 16–22 on whoever was in the way. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"Three stones, one decision: not this way."},
    "minotauro-fogo-20": {"name":"Living Anvil","description":"160 shield and 35% damage reflected, for 3 turns, on an ally.","flavor":"Whoever hits the anvil learns about the anvil."},
    "minotauro-fogo-30": {"name":"The Closed Forge","description":"Closes a ring of walls in radius 2 around you and gains 180 shield for 3 turns. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"The forge has no door. Whoever came in, stays."},
    "minotauro-agua-5": {"name":"Slippery Wall","description":"2-turn wall with wet ground around it: anyone who gets close slips. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"Stone stops the body. The puddle decides the rest."},
    "minotauro-agua-10": {"name":"Tide Hoof","description":"90 shield and 16–24 HP per turn, for 3 turns.","flavor":"The tide hits and returns. Always returns."},
    "minotauro-agua-12": {"name":"Wave Shove","description":"19–26 water in a fan and 2 tiles of push.","flavor":"Nobody holds water. It holds you."},
    "minotauro-agua-15": {"name":"Dike","description":"A line of 3 walls for 3 turns, pushing 1 tile whoever was there. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"The river doesn't argue with the dike. It just goes around."},
    "minotauro-agua-20": {"name":"Guarded Cistern","description":"120 shield and 20–28 regeneration per turn, for you and anyone in radius 2.","flavor":"He guards the water. The water guards everyone."},
    "minotauro-agua-30": {"name":"The Siege of Water","description":"Ring of walls in radius 2 on the target: 22–30 water and 1 push on whoever stayed inside. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"Surrounding isn't trapping. It's choosing his exit for him."},
    "minotauro-terra-5": {"name":"Menhir","description":"Raises a wall that lasts 4 turns — the most stubborn of the four paths. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"They put it there before there was a road. The road went around."},
    "minotauro-terra-10": {"name":"Stone Shell","description":"140 shield — the thickest in the game — and +20% earth resistance for 2 turns.","flavor":"It isn't armor. It's the ground saying not today."},
    "minotauro-terra-12": {"name":"Hoof Thump","description":"20–27 earth in radius 1 and 0 MP for 1 turn on anyone nearby.","flavor":"The ground shakes once. Whoever was standing learns."},
    "minotauro-terra-15": {"name":"Rampart","description":"Three walls in a line, standing for 4 turns. Cuts the room in two. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"Every rampart is a short sentence: no."},
    "minotauro-terra-20": {"name":"Foundation","description":"190 shield and +15% resistance for you and allies in radius 1, for 3 turns.","flavor":"He doesn't raise a wall. He raises the ground."},
    "minotauro-terra-30": {"name":"The Labyrinth","description":"Cross of 4-turn walls around the target, and 0 MP for 1 turn on whoever is inside. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"The labyrinth is his. You're just passing through."},
    "minotauro-ar-5": {"name":"Wall of Breath","description":"1-turn wall, but raised from afar — and leaves a gust armed around it. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"It lasts an instant. The instant was what was missing."},
    "minotauro-ar-10": {"name":"Light Shield","description":"70 shield and +1 MP for 2 turns — the shield that weighs nothing.","flavor":"Protecting isn't pinning in place."},
    "minotauro-ar-12": {"name":"Wind Horn","description":"21–29 air in a line of 3 and 2 tiles of push.","flavor":"The charge passes. Its wind continues."},
    "minotauro-ar-15": {"name":"Flying Fence","description":"Three walls in a line, raised 6 tiles away — the class's longest range. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"He closes the door on the other side of the room."},
    "minotauro-ar-20": {"name":"Wandering Guard","description":"130 shield and +2 MP for 3 turns. Protects whoever needs to run.","flavor":"His guard walks with you."},
    "minotauro-ar-30": {"name":"The Wind Pen","description":"Ring of walls up to 6 tiles away: pushes 2, deals 22–30 air and closes the siege. Spikes deal 30 to any enemy who ends its turn adjacent or is thrown into the stone.","flavor":"A corral doesn't need to be big. It needs to be closed."}
  },
  "monsterSpells": {
    "m-thorn-shot": {"name":"Barb","description":"The Lasher whips the air and fires a barbed thorn that whistles until it hits.","flavor":"She doesn't chase anyone. She doesn't have to."},
    "m-root-grip": {"name":"Lock Root","description":"Roots burst from the floor and seize the target's ankles: rooted for 1 turn.","flavor":"The greenhouse thinks you're fertilizer on the move."},
    "m-pollen-bite": {"name":"Nibble","description":"A cute bite from pollen teeth. The real danger comes later.","flavor":"He smiles all the time. Stitched, but smiling."},
    "m-burr-hug": {"name":"Barbed Embrace","description":"The burr hurls itself at the target and clings, barbs inward.","flavor":"Yarn-ball affection: it hurts and won't come off."},
    "m-wasp-sting": {"name":"Gleaming Sting","description":"The wasp's stinger injects a glowing venom that burns for 2 turns.","flavor":"The glow on its abdomen is the garden's last friendly warning."},
    "m-sap-mend": {"name":"Sweet Sap","description":"The Sapper pours golden sap over an ally's wounds.","flavor":"Waters everything with the same care. Even what should die."},
    "m-sap-sugar": {"name":"Raw Sugar","description":"A dose of raw sugar sends the ally into a frenzy: +15 power for 2 turns.","flavor":"No plant in this room knows what moderation is."},
    "m-dew-web": {"name":"Dew Web","description":"Heavy strands of dew close over the target's feet and harden: rooted for 1 turn.","flavor":"Every drop on the web is a magnifying glass. She likes a close look."},
    "m-dew-bite": {"name":"Dew Sting","description":"The chelicerae inject a drop of old, still water that rots from within.","flavor":"Greenhouse water: never boiled, never dried, never forgave."},
    "m-shears": {"name":"Snip","description":"The Gardener's pruning shears close with a wet snap.","flavor":"She doesn't kill. She trims."},
    "m-vine-hook": {"name":"Hook Vine","description":"A barbed vine hooks the target and drags it 3 tiles to the shears.","flavor":"A weed doesn't choose where it's pulled up."},
    "m-seed-toss": {"name":"Sowing","description":"The Gardener plants a seed that sprouts at once, ravenous.","flavor":"Her garden never had a dead season."},
    "m-thorn-crown": {"name":"Crown of Thorns","description":"A ring of thorns sprouts 2 tiles from the Gardener and closes in: damage and root on whoever's around — but not on whoever's glued to her.","flavor":"Too close for the crown. The only safe place in the bandstand."},
    "m-sprout-bite": {"name":"Tiny Teeth","description":"The sprout bites with all its rows of seed teeth.","flavor":"Born ten seconds ago and already has enemies."},
    "m-burr-nip": {"name":"Little Barb","description":"Small, sticky and annoying.","flavor":"Half the grudge, double the speed."},
    "m-spore-nip": {"name":"Rotten Nibble","description":"The sporeling bites and leaves mold in the wound.","flavor":"Eyes too big, loyalty bigger still."},
    "m-drowned-bite": {"name":"Big Bite","description":"The drownling bites and drinks: steals the life it lacks.","flavor":"He isn't hungry. He's cold."},
    "m-eel-beam": {"name":"Low Note","description":"The moray blows a note through the flute of its own skull: a straight jet of water.","flavor":"Get out of the line. She puts you back in it."},
    "m-eel-hook": {"name":"Hook Tongue","description":"A harpoon tongue shoots in a straight line and drags the prey toward the water.","flavor":"Formal invitation from the Drowned Court."},
    "m-jelly-mend": {"name":"Saline Pulse","description":"The jellyfish pulses and bathes an ally in restorative brine.","flavor":"Put out the chandelier before arguing with the guests."},
    "m-jelly-ward": {"name":"Membrane","description":"A gelatinous film wraps the ally, absorbing blows.","flavor":"Translucent, lukewarm, deeply unpleasant."},
    "m-brine-fist": {"name":"Brine Fist","description":"A fist of packed salt comes down like a ram.","flavor":"Low tide for walking, high tide for hitting."},
    "m-drop-slam": {"name":"Squelch","description":"The drop throws itself whole onto the target. It's exactly the sound you imagine.","flavor":"Squelch."},
    "m-droplet-splash": {"name":"Drip","description":"The droplet hurls itself at the target's shin with all the indignation it can muster. Plip.","flavor":"Small, round, indignant."},
    "m-crab-pinch": {"name":"Sinkhole Pincer","description":"The pincer snaps shut with a stony crack and sends the target back one tile.","flavor":"He lives in the drain. The drain is his."},
    "m-crab-guard": {"name":"Shut Shell","description":"The crab shuts itself in whole: 25 shield and +20% Water resistance for 2 turns.","flavor":"A thousand years underwater teach you to close the door."},
    "m-mist-song": {"name":"Mist Song","description":"A thin, off-key whistle makes the ally slippery: +12 dodge for 2 turns.","flavor":"The right note is the one nobody can hold."},
    "m-mist-shove": {"name":"Mist Breath","description":"A damp gust pushes the target 2 tiles — preferably into the channel.","flavor":"The cistern has many holes and no patience."},
    "m-tide-pull": {"name":"Hungry Tide","description":"The Baroness inhales — and the whole room becomes tide: everything within 3 tiles is dragged to her.","flavor":"She receives. Nobody turns down a hostess's invitation."},
    "m-bitter-gulp": {"name":"Bitter Gulp","description":"The Baroness swallows everything around her in one gulp of acid brine, which keeps corroding for 2 turns.","flavor":"Pulls one turn, drinks the next. Step out in between."},
    "m-salt-lance": {"name":"Salt Lance","description":"A sharp salt crystal spins across the room.","flavor":"Court cutlery."},
    "m-brine-spawn": {"name":"Pour","description":"The Baroness overflows, and what spills takes on a will of its own.","flavor":"Every ball has guests nobody invited."},
    "m-ember-claw": {"name":"Lit Claw","description":"The brand rends with claws of living ember.","flavor":"The laughter is the fuse."},
    "m-anvil-crush": {"name":"Crush","description":"The anvil simply falls on top. Basic physics, excellent results.","flavor":"Mention it last, but mention it."},
    "m-ash-bolt": {"name":"Ash Arrow","description":"The ashen one points a finger and the soot obeys, flying as an arrow.","flavor":"Soot is just fire that learned to float."},
    "m-ash-veil": {"name":"Ash Shroud","description":"The ashen one dissolves into soot hanging for 1 turn: impossible to target.","flavor":"Change targets — or guess."},
    "m-slag-slam": {"name":"Dead Weight","description":"The slag heap collapses onto the target in slow motion, boiling.","flavor":"A death in three acts starts here."},
    "m-smith-hammer": {"name":"Sledge Blow","description":"The smith treats the target like a badly forged piece.","flavor":"No face, no hurry, no mistakes."},
    "m-forge-temper": {"name":"Tempering","description":"The smith hammers the ally like sharpening a weapon: +20 power for 2 turns.","flavor":"A tempered Anvil takes a hero apart."},
    "m-smith-plate": {"name":"Hot Plate","description":"A plate of still-red metal is welded onto the ally: 20 shield.","flavor":"It hurts both. Only one cares."},
    "m-quench-lunge": {"name":"Tempering Lunge","description":"The hound leaps from the tempering pit up to 4 tiles and bites, still dripping.","flavor":"Born of the water that quenches swords."},
    "m-quench-hiss": {"name":"Hiss","description":"A jet of boiling steam peels the target's shield off before scalding it.","flavor":"The sound a protection makes when it gives up."},
    "m-chain-yank": {"name":"Chain Pull","description":"The ceiling chain nooses the target, drags 3 tiles and pins it to the hook for 1 turn.","flavor":"The forge always needed hanging meat."},
    "m-chain-lash": {"name":"Chain Surge","description":"Thick links swing and slam flat.","flavor":"Nothing elegant. Very effective."},
    "m-doom-hammer": {"name":"Hammer of the End","description":"Magno raises the hammer that forged the first Lock — and the world creaks when it comes down.","flavor":"The whole cross pays for the target he chose."},
    "m-bellows-blast": {"name":"Furnace Breath","description":"Magno's furnace chest exhales a glowing gale that hurls the target 3 tiles.","flavor":"With your back to the pit, that's a sentence."},
    "m-spark-call": {"name":"Call Sparks","description":"Magno snaps his fingers and a spark grows legs — and terrible intentions.","flavor":"He manufactures his own disposable army."},
    "m-heart-brand": {"name":"Mark of the Kindler","description":"Magno touches the flame to the target and leaves a glowing mark: +5% damage taken per stack, up to 5 stacks.","flavor":"He marks the piece before hitting it."},
    "m-anvil-verdict": {"name":"Anvil's Verdict","description":"Magno consumes all the target's marks at once: 9 damage per stack.","flavor":"The marked piece goes back to the anvil. Always."},
    "m-stoke": {"name":"Stoke Up","description":"Magno opens the grate in his chest and blows on the embers: +25 power.","flavor":"The furnace breathes. The second half of the fight is another fight."},
    "m-spark-tap": {"name":"Snap","description":"The spark touches and pops. It hurts more than it looks.","flavor":"Lives short, ends loud."},
    "m-slag-drip": {"name":"Splash","description":"A splash of boiling slag.","flavor":"A still-red shard, crawling with purpose."},
    "m-shrike-dive": {"name":"Skim","description":"The shrike drops straight down the scaffold shaft and strikes at the end of the fall.","flavor":"He uses height like a weapon. Because it is."},
    "m-shrike-peck": {"name":"Plank Peck","description":"A sharp peck that pushes the target back one tile — and on a scaffold, one tile is a lot.","flavor":"He impales what's left on the nails."},
    "m-gremlin-shove": {"name":"Shove","description":"The gremlin gives an enthusiastic shoulder and sends the target 2 tiles where there is no floor.","flavor":"He finds this hilarious. Every day."},
    "m-gremlin-swap": {"name":"Plank Swap","description":"The gremlin swaps places with the victim — almost always to put them on the edge.","flavor":"He never ends up on the worst plank."},
    "m-rope-noose": {"name":"Work Noose","description":"The rope comes in a straight line, nooses and reels in 3 tiles — and the knot holds for 1 turn.","flavor":"The worksite collects its material."},
    "m-rope-cinch": {"name":"Knot Tightening","description":"The knot tightens and leaves the rope's mark in the flesh: +4% damage taken per stack.","flavor":"Every turn of the rope is a promise."},
    "m-kite-arc": {"name":"Cask Arc","description":"The cask wyrm's line streaks the charged air and leaps to up to 2 neighboring enemies, weakening with each leap.","flavor":"In a gale, everything here is a lightning rod."},
    "m-kite-whip": {"name":"Line Whip","description":"The ribbon tail cuts with the ground-glass edge that coats it.","flavor":"A blind kite string cuts its owner's neck."},
    "m-ballast-drop": {"name":"Ballast Drop","description":"The golem dumps a sack of stones from its own torso onto the target.","flavor":"He's the only one here with any weight. He insists on proving it."},
    "m-ballast-anchor": {"name":"Anchor","description":"The golem plants its feet in the scaffold joints: 30 shield and taunt for 2 turns.","flavor":"While he holds back the wind, the wind consumes him."},
    "m-choir-hymn": {"name":"Coral Whistle","description":"The choir's pipes tune to the same note: the ally recovers and becomes more slippery.","flavor":"When they sing together, the whole worksite vibrates."},
    "m-choir-clear": {"name":"Clean Breath","description":"A clean gust clears poison, knots and marks from the ally, and leaves a warm current regenerating.","flavor":"Ventilation is the local religion."},
    "m-mote-buzz": {"name":"Buzz","description":"The swarm skims past and takes a piece along.","flavor":"A thousand little bugs, one opinion."},
    "m-mote-nip": {"name":"Mote Sting","description":"A lone mote does what it can.","flavor":"Alone, comical. In pairs, not so much."},
    "m-nail-jab": {"name":"Skewer","description":"A living nail jumps and buries itself where it lands.","flavor":"The worksite still has nails to spare."},
    "m-scaffold-collapse": {"name":"Collapse the Wing","description":"Cambota kicks the main beam and the whole line gives way: damage and a 3-tile throw.","flavor":"He tears down his own worksite without hesitating. Rebuilds later."},
    "m-rivet-volley": {"name":"Rivet Volley","description":"A fan of glowing rivets driven into a 3-tile cone: each rivet is an open mark.","flavor":"He turns you into part of the structure."},
    "m-raise-frame": {"name":"Raise Plumb","description":"Cambota drives in a fresh frame and a nail imp walks out of it.","flavor":"The work never stops. That's the problem."},
    "m-headwind": {"name":"Headwind","description":"Cambota opens every sluice in the shaft: the gale blows again and he becomes impossible to hold.","flavor":"The room is his tool. You're the one visiting."},
    "m-pick-swing": {"name":"Pickaxe Swing","description":"The pickaxe opens a fissure in the armor and leaves the vein's mark: +5% damage taken per stack.","flavor":"He reads you the way he reads rock: looking for where it cracks."},
    "m-pick-verdict": {"name":"Vein Strike","description":"The haunt strikes exactly where it marked and the rock gives way: 7 damage per stack.","flavor":"Every stone has just one blow. He memorized yours."},
    "m-firedamp-flare": {"name":"Firedamp Flare","description":"The blaze spits a blue tongue of ignited gas down the gallery.","flavor":"Gas has no smell. The warning is the light."},
    "m-firedamp-cloud": {"name":"Gas Pocket","description":"An invisible pocket bursts and burns the lungs of anyone in the area for 2 turns.","flavor":"Miners brought birds. You brought heroes."},
    "m-cave-bite": {"name":"Big Mouthful","description":"The gallery closes on Bocarra's stone teeth.","flavor":"You thought it was a tunnel."},
    "m-cave-roar": {"name":"Gallery Roar","description":"The roar runs along the cross of galleries and forces everyone to look at it for 2 turns.","flavor":"A big mouth that demands an audience."},
    "m-crystal-chant": {"name":"Crystal Song","description":"The crystal resonates at the frequency of living rock and restores the ally.","flavor":"The mine sings back to those who dig properly."},
    "m-crystal-facet": {"name":"Mirrored Facet","description":"A quartz shell covers the ally: 22 shield and 20% of damage taken goes back to the attacker.","flavor":"Hitting him is hitting yourself, delayed."},
    "m-worm-drag": {"name":"Cave-in Drag","description":"The floor collapses into a funnel and the target slides 3 tiles to the worm's mouth, stuck in the sand.","flavor":"The floor is an opinion. He disagrees."},
    "m-worm-spit": {"name":"Gravel Spit","description":"A burst of crushed gravel, hot from friction.","flavor":"He chews the mine and returns the useless part."},
    "m-tumbler-roll": {"name":"Roll","description":"The ore roller gains momentum for up to 4 tiles and runs over whatever is at the end of the track.","flavor":"The whole mine is a slope, if you're round."},
    "m-ore-chip-hit": {"name":"Chip","description":"A chip of ore hurls itself at the target's shin.","flavor":"The roller's payback."},
    "m-bat-screech": {"name":"Winch Screech","description":"A screech so shrill it pushes the air — and the target with it.","flavor":"He sees with that. You just feel it."},
    "m-bat-swoop": {"name":"Swooping Flight","description":"The bat crosses the shaft diagonally and skims past with its claws.","flavor":"In Tremor it loses 5 HP per turn. It insists anyway."},
    "m-seep-drip": {"name":"Acid Drip","description":"The runoff hurls mine water — mineral, old and corrosive — that keeps eating for 2 turns.","flavor":"A thousand years filtering poison from the rock."},
    "m-seep-solvent": {"name":"Solvent","description":"A squirt dissolves the target's shield as if it were salt.","flavor":"Nothing down here stays protected forever."},
    "m-deep-knock": {"name":"The Knock","description":"Batepedra knocks the floor once and the ring 2 tiles around him cracks: damage and feet stuck for 1 turn.","flavor":"The miners counted the knocks. Whoever reached three never came back."},
    "m-rockfall": {"name":"Collapse","description":"He points at the ceiling and the ceiling obeys: area rockfall, and whatever's left is thrown 2 tiles.","flavor":"The mine collapses with aim."},
    "m-vein-call": {"name":"Call the Vein","description":"Batepedra tears a handful from the vein and the handful starts walking.","flavor":"Ore is people too, down here."},
    "m-quake-stance": {"name":"Tremor Stance","description":"He sits on his own weight and the whole mine shakes with him: Tremor returns, 40 shield and 25% of damage reflected.","flavor":"Weather is his weapon. Taking him out of Tremor is half the fight."},
    "m-cinder-lash": {"name":"Ember Lash","description":"The herald cracks an ember whip across the broken room.","flavor":"A quarter of the Heart still burns."},
    "m-cinder-brand": {"name":"Sow Ember","description":"The herald buries a living ember in the tile: whoever steps on it in the next 3 turns triggers the trap.","flavor":"The floor of this room has memory and grudges."},
    "m-cinder-trap": {"name":"Awakened Ember","description":"The buried ember bursts underfoot and spits fire in a 1-tile circle. (Trap: triggers when stepped on, not cast.)","flavor":"You found the place where he planted."},
    "m-tide-hymn": {"name":"Tide Hymn","description":"The tide washes the ally: deep heal and carries off poison, roots and marks.","flavor":"Water doesn't forgive: it only undoes."},
    "m-tide-drag": {"name":"Undertow","description":"The undertow drags everything within a 2-tile radius 2 tiles — back to the middle of the broken room.","flavor":"Nobody chooses where the tide leaves them."},
    "m-stone-fist": {"name":"Foundation Fist","description":"A foundation fist comes down with the weight of everything it holds up.","flavor":"He holds up the ceiling. He reminds you of it."},
    "m-stone-bulwark": {"name":"Bulwark","description":"The herald plants his feet and becomes a wall: 35 shield and taunt for 2 turns.","flavor":"The only door is him."},
    "m-gale-step": {"name":"Gale Step","description":"The herald crosses 5 tiles like a draft and materializes the cut on arrival.","flavor":"He was already there when you decided to retreat."},
    "m-gale-cut": {"name":"Current Cut","description":"A blade of compressed air cuts and sends the target back 2 tiles.","flavor":"The broken room has many edges."},
    "m-null-hush": {"name":"Warden's Silence","description":"The warden wipes out the target's protection with the gesture of someone closing a window — and charges a toll.","flavor":"He hates no one. He just organizes."},
    "m-null-mend": {"name":"Warden's Patch","description":"Cleans the ally of everything that stuck and leaves a patch that closes on its own for 2 turns.","flavor":"Tending is removing what doesn't belong."},
    "m-mirror-cut": {"name":"Mirrored Cut","description":"The twin repeats your last blow, with the hand switched.","flavor":"He learned it watching you."},
    "m-mirror-guard": {"name":"Mirror Guard","description":"20 shield and 30% of damage taken goes back to the aggressor for 2 turns.","flavor":"Hurt him fast or hurt yourself slowly."},
    "m-sliver-shard": {"name":"Splinter","description":"A shard of the twin hurls itself.","flavor":"Every broken mirror keeps looking."},
    "m-turn-rain": {"name":"Turn to Rain","description":"The mote tilts the room toward water: rain starts, and he takes the chance to soak anyone who was dry.","flavor":"He changes the weather for fun. That's all."},
    "m-turn-drought": {"name":"Turn to Drought","description":"The mote dries the room's air in a blink: drought — and a lick of heat on the target.","flavor":"Whoever chose Water just got a worse deal."},
    "m-turn-gale": {"name":"Turn to Gale","description":"The mote opens the Heart's fissures and the gale rushes in, tearing.","flavor":"Three weathers, one creature, no shame."},
    "m-heartroot-lash": {"name":"Root Lash","description":"The heartroot whips and drives its tip into the target's foot: stuck for 1 turn.","flavor":"It still tries to hold the whole Heart."},
    "m-heartroot-grasp": {"name":"Seize","description":"The root wraps the ankle and reels in 2 tiles.","flavor":"It keeps everything it can pull."},
    "m-season-ember": {"name":"Ember Season","description":"The Heart's ember quarter beats: the whole room dries and a 1-tile circle catches fire.","flavor":"One of the four seasons it carries. Never the same twice in a row."},
    "m-season-tide": {"name":"Tide Season","description":"The water quarter beats: it starts raining inside the room and the area floods with the force of breakers.","flavor":"If you chose Fire, this is the turn to back off."},
    "m-season-gale": {"name":"Gale Season","description":"The air quarter beats: gale in the room and a straight blade that hurls 3 tiles.","flavor":"The Heart's crack is a mouth blowing."},
    "m-season-quake": {"name":"Tremor Season","description":"The stone quarter beats: the whole world's mine shakes and the ring 2 tiles out cracks and pins.","flavor":"The Lousa sinks another handspan with each of those beats."},
    "m-shard-storm": {"name":"Shard Storm","description":"Shards of the Heart itself leap from enemy to enemy, up to 3 leaps, losing strength with each.","flavor":"He shatters a bit more each time. Doesn't seem to mind."},
    "m-mend-rift": {"name":"Darn the Rift","description":"The Heart pulls its own edges together and stitches itself: deep heal and 40 shield.","flavor":"A thousand years cracking and he still tries."},
    "m-splinter-call": {"name":"Call Splinters","description":"A shard breaks off the Heart and lands on its feet, already angry.","flavor":"Every splinter remembers being whole."},
    "m-sum-familiar-bite": {"name":"Familiar's Bite","description":"The familiar bites with the conviction of one with no name to uphold.","flavor":"A name is a commitment. He only has teeth."},
    "m-sum-hound-bite": {"name":"Hot Bite","description":"The ember hound bites and leaves the mark of hot iron.","flavor":"Wags its tail. The tail lights the floor."},
    "m-sum-colossus-smash": {"name":"Magma Maul","description":"The colossus brings down its molten arm like closing a gate.","flavor":"Nobody had invited him since the Lousa."},
    "m-sum-colossus-eruption": {"name":"Eruption","description":"The ground opens in a 1-tile circle and spits magma that keeps burning.","flavor":"His heat is what changes the room's weather."},
    "m-sum-nymph-mend": {"name":"Tide Hand","description":"The nymph touches the ally's wound and the water decides to close it.","flavor":"She never speaks. Just looks at whoever is bleeding and handles it."},
    "m-sum-nymph-veil": {"name":"Water Veil","description":"A film of still water wraps the ally: 13 shield for 2 turns.","flavor":"Still water holds more than angry water."},
    "m-sum-sentinel-slam": {"name":"Sentinel Slam","description":"The sentinel strikes once, with all its weight, without leaving its spot.","flavor":"Stays where it was put."},
    "m-sum-sentinel-guard": {"name":"Take Post","description":"The sentinel plants its feet and calls the whole corridor to itself: 18 shield and taunt.","flavor":"The summoner's corridor plug."},
    "m-sum-golem-fist": {"name":"Mountain Fist","description":"A fist the size of a door comes down with a hillside's patience.","flavor":"He only asked whether the mountain was up for a few steps."},
    "m-sum-golem-quake": {"name":"Mountain Step","description":"One step, and the cross around it cracks: area damage and feet stuck for 1 turn.","flavor":"The mountain doesn't run. The mountain arrives."},
    "m-sum-drowned-drag": {"name":"Deep Stroke","description":"The heavy arm reaches far and brings the target 2 tiles closer.","flavor":"Doesn't pull to kill. Pulls to avoid being alone."},
    "m-sum-drowned-weight": {"name":"Water Weight","description":"Dumps its own body onto whoever is adjacent: hurts and pins to the ground for one turn.","flavor":"Drowning is a matter of patience."},
    "m-sum-eye-gale": {"name":"Short Gale","description":"Spreads its arms and whatever is around goes back 2 tiles, bruised.","flavor":"He doesn't expel out of anger. He expels out of habit."},
    "m-sum-eye-calm": {"name":"Dull Mind","description":"Inside the spiral the wind doesn't strike: anyone nearby gains 34 shield for 2 turns.","flavor":"In the middle of the storm there's a still place."},
    "m-sum-falcon-strike": {"name":"Storm Peck","description":"The beak hits with the wind behind it and sends the target back 2 tiles.","flavor":"There's no sky for it to fly in. Flies anyway, out of spite."},
    "m-sum-falcon-dive": {"name":"Dive","description":"The falcon folds its wings, crosses up to 5 tiles and opens its talons at the end.","flavor":"Arrives before everyone, including the plan."},
    "m-colosso-punho-lava": {"name":"Lava Fist","description":"The colossus brings down a fist of cracked rock; lava from the fissures splashes whoever takes it.","flavor":"Each of his punches leaves the ground hotter than before."},
    "m-colosso-erupcao": {"name":"Eruption","description":"The body's fissures open at once and spit lava onto every tile adjacent to it.","flavor":"Staying close is the only way to hit him. He knows."},
    "m-colosso-brasa-chao": {"name":"Ember Floor","description":"The tile the Ember Colossus walked over still burns: burns whoever steps on it. (Trail: born from its step, not cast.)","flavor":"He doesn't walk. He melts the path."},
    "m-colosso-onda": {"name":"Broken Wave","description":"An arm of coral and living water breaks over the target like a wave on stone, and pushes it 1 tile.","flavor":"The buried sea still remembers the tides."},
    "m-colosso-tromba": {"name":"Waterspout","description":"The colossus spits a column of water that sweeps 3 tiles in a line.","flavor":"Everything he swallows comes back. Hard."},
    "m-colosso-esmaga": {"name":"Smash","description":"A fist the size of a man falls on the target.","flavor":"Stone is in no hurry. Stone has weight."},
    "m-colosso-tremor": {"name":"Carapace Tremor","description":"The colossus stamps: the ground cracks in a cross at the target, hurting and pinning for 1 turn.","flavor":"The Pit's floor obeys whoever weighs most."},
    "m-colosso-rajada": {"name":"Trapped Gust","description":"One of the wind currents escapes the body and hits the target, who flies 2 tiles.","flavor":"Trapped wind wants out. Out it goes, on top of someone."},
    "m-colosso-ciclone": {"name":"Short Cyclone","description":"The currents spin: a ring of wind 2 tiles out hurts and pulls 1 tile toward him.","flavor":"Whoever fled him comes back, one way or another."},
    "m-vigia-olhar": {"name":"Ember Gaze","description":"The single eye in the wax lights up and draws a line of ember to the target — from afar, and in the dark, where only it sees.","flavor":"You can't see him. He doesn't need you to."},
    "m-vigia-pavio": {"name":"Lit Wick","description":"A thread of boiling wax sticks to the target and keeps burning for 2 turns.","flavor":"The candle went out a thousand years ago. The wax didn't."},
    "m-mariposa-roce": {"name":"Ash Brush","description":"The wings brush the target and leave a streak of hot ash.","flavor":"She doesn't attack the light. She attacks whoever is in it."},
    "m-mariposa-po": {"name":"Wing Dust","description":"A cloud of wing dust blinds and weighs: hurts and cuts 14 dodge for 2 turns.","flavor":"Whoever sneezes can't dodge."},
    "m-caramujo-bater": {"name":"Sluice Slam","description":"The bronze shell shuts over the target like a sluice and pushes it 1 tile.","flavor":"From the bridge to the water is one step. He takes the step for you."},
    "m-caramujo-fechar": {"name":"Close the Sluice","description":"The snail retreats behind the riveted sluice: 40 shield for 2 turns.","flavor":"Shut, it held the whole gallery for a thousand years."},
    "m-garca-arpao": {"name":"Harpoon Beak","description":"The neck stretches at once and the barbed beak hits the target from afar.","flavor":"She fishes standing still. You're the one moving."},
    "m-garca-fisga": {"name":"Hook-Snatch","description":"The harpoon sinks in and returns: hurts and pulls the target 2 tiles toward her — into the water.","flavor":"What she hooks, the current finishes."},
    "m-pilarete-soco": {"name":"Drum Punch","description":"An arm of stacked stone drums comes down whole on the target.","flavor":"A column is in no hurry. A column has weight."},
    "m-pilarete-tambor": {"name":"Drumroll","description":"The Bollard drops a drum from its own arm and rolls it in a straight line: hits whoever is ahead, up to 4 tiles. A standing pillar in the way stops it.","flavor":"He doesn't come to you. He sends a piece."},
    "m-pilarete-assentar": {"name":"Settle","description":"The Bollard settles onto the ground like a descending pillar: hurts and pins for 1 turn whoever is adjacent.","flavor":"The whole hall does this. He learned by watching."},
    "m-toupeira-garra": {"name":"Spade Claw","description":"The digging claws open whatever's in front.","flavor":"She dug the sanctuary. You're softer than stone."},
    "m-toupeira-tunel": {"name":"Rise from the Ground","description":"The mole vanishes into the floor, crosses up to 5 tiles in a line and surfaces at the target's feet, claws open.","flavor":"A standing pillar makes her go around. A low pillar is a door."},
    "m-catavento-sopro": {"name":"Propeller Breath","description":"The vaned helm spins and the breath hits from afar: hurts and pushes 1 tile.","flavor":"On the terrace his wind goes one tile farther. Your Air does too."},
    "m-catavento-leque": {"name":"Fan Gust","description":"The spade hands open and the gust fans out: hurts and pushes 2 tiles whoever is in it.","flavor":"A wall behind you is part of the blow."},
    "m-arraia-rasante": {"name":"Skim","description":"The broad wing passes close and cuts.","flavor":"She doesn't land. She passes."},
    "m-arraia-planar": {"name":"Glide on the Gust","description":"The ray lies down on the wind, glides up to 4 tiles and arrives striking.","flavor":"The terrace carries whoever knows how to lie down on it."},
    "m-eco-pulso": {"name":"Core Pulse","description":"The core in the Echo's chest beats once and the beat crosses the chamber to whoever it chose.","flavor":"The first sound of the buried world. Still echoing."},
    "m-eco-brasa": {"name":"First Lava","description":"One of the Echo's lava fissures opens and spits a 1-tile circle of embers.","flavor":"The Lock's lava came from here."},
    "m-eco-centelha": {"name":"Ancient Spark","description":"A spark as old as the deep leaps from the Echo's chest straight at a hero.","flavor":"Still warm, after everything."},
    "m-eco-mare": {"name":"First Tide","description":"The Echo's coral cracks and a 4-tile line of dark water runs across the floor.","flavor":"The Cistern is just what's left of this tide."},
    "m-eco-gota": {"name":"Coral Drop","description":"A water-filled coral shard bursts on the hero the Echo chose.","flavor":"Sharp as salt."},
    "m-eco-rocha": {"name":"First Rock","description":"A rock fist of the Echo comes down on a 1-tile cross.","flavor":"The world's foundation has an owner."},
    "m-eco-lasca": {"name":"Crystal Splinter","description":"A crystal from the Echo's shoulder breaks loose and flies straight at a hero.","flavor":"Every splinter of it is a whole mine."},
    "m-eco-vento": {"name":"Loose Current","description":"One of the chains binding the wind to the Echo breaks loose and leaps from hero to hero, 2 leaps.","flavor":"Trapped wind wants out. It goes out through you."},
    "m-eco-corte": {"name":"Current Cut","description":"A blade of wind cuts the hero and pushes them one tile away from the Echo.","flavor":"He wants no one near the core."},
    "m-eco-menor-brasa": {"name":"Lesser Spark","description":"The Lesser Ember Echo hurls a piece of its own lava.","flavor":"It repeats the bigger one, lower."},
    "m-eco-menor-mare": {"name":"Lesser Splash","description":"The Lesser Coral Echo splashes salt water on the nearest hero.","flavor":"A splash of the tide from before."},
    "m-eco-menor-rocha": {"name":"Lesser Thump","description":"The Lesser Rock Echo slams its whole body into whoever is adjacent.","flavor":"Little, but heavy."},
    "m-eco-menor-vento": {"name":"Lesser Gust","description":"The Lesser Wind Echo blows hard: cuts and pushes one tile.","flavor":"A thread of the wind the greater one holds."}
  },
  "itemSpells": {
    "is-seed-bomb": {"name":"Seed Bomb","description":"Hurls a handful of bursting pod seeds: they open in midair and sprout inside whoever is in the circle.","flavor":"The greenhouse keeps sowing. You just choose where."},
    "is-thorn-ward": {"name":"Thorn Vial","description":"Emergency shield: a thorn hedge closes around the body and returns part of what hits it.","flavor":"Grows too fast to be polite."},
    "is-undertow": {"name":"Undertow","description":"Opens a short current on the ground that drags the target three tiles toward you.","flavor":"The cistern never returned anything for free — but it returns."},
    "is-tide-mend": {"name":"Gentle Tide","description":"A low wave passes over the ally, closes what was open and carries off poison and roots.","flavor":"Water still for a thousand years knows how to rise when asked."},
    "is-cinder-leap": {"name":"Ember Leap","description":"The body becomes a spark, crosses the air and reassembles on the chosen tile — the arrival burst burns the surroundings.","flavor":"Arriving is easy. Warning people is the hard part."},
    "is-forge-brand": {"name":"Branding Iron","description":"Brands the enemy with the forge's mark: everything that hits them afterward hurts more.","flavor":"The Lock brands its cattle. Now you do too."},
    "is-updraft": {"name":"Puff","description":"A column of air rises beneath the enemy and throws them three tiles back — on a scaffold, that usually settles the argument.","flavor":"The Scaffolds' wind doesn't push: it publishes opinions."},
    "is-storm-chain": {"name":"Storm Current","description":"Elemental current: the lightning jumps from enemy to enemy up to three times, losing strength with each leap.","flavor":"Counts the bodies on its own. Always counts right."},
    "is-quake-nail": {"name":"Tremor Nail","description":"An ore nail is driven into the ground under the target: it stays two turns exactly where it is.","flavor":"The mine pins everything that moves too much."},
    "is-ore-bulwark": {"name":"Ore Prop","description":"A prop of raw ore rises from the ground in front of the ally: thick shield and no one slips away from beside it.","flavor":"They propped the ceiling with this for a thousand years. The ceiling is still there."},
    "is-heart-call": {"name":"Call of the Heart","description":"The shard plays a note the Broken Heart recognizes: everything hostile within three tiles is dragged close to you.","flavor":"Calling everyone at once is a decision. Good luck."},
    "is-heart-whole": {"name":"Whole Heart","description":"With all four pieces closed, the Broken Heart beats whole again for an instant: poison leaves, the wound closes, the shell thickens, the blow returns the way it came — and the whole room goes still.","flavor":"A thousand years cracked. One whole instant. Make it count."},
    "is-heart-eclipse": {"name":"Eclipse","description":"The lens erases the room's weather for an instant and what's left falls on the enemy with no shield and no element to lean on.","flavor":"For a second, nobody has any advantage. Use the second."},
    "is-swarm-sting": {"name":"Swarm Sting","description":"Opens the honeycomb hatch and looses three wasps at once: they hop from enemy to enemy, losing strength with each jump, and leave the sting working for two turns.","flavor":"They come back on their own. They count who's missing."},
    "is-silt-grip": {"name":"Mud Grab","description":"Drain sludge rises in a pincer and closes around everyone's feet in the circle: it hurts as it squeezes and lets no one leave where they stood.","flavor":"The drain is private property. You were warned."},
    "is-quench-hiss": {"name":"Tempering Hiss","description":"Pours the temper pit water on the target: the steam cloud burns from within and snuffs out any magic shell it has lit.","flavor":"That's how everything here got tempered. People included."},
    "is-noose-drag": {"name":"Pulley Noose","description":"Throws a work-rope noose and reels in: drags the target three tiles closer and leaves the knot tight on the ankle for one turn.","flavor":"Material that reaches the platform doesn't come back."},
    "is-firedamp-blast": {"name":"Firedamp Burst","description":"Opens the lamp screen on purpose and lets the gallery gas meet the flame: the whole pocket bursts two tiles ahead and the blast pushes away anyone nearby.","flavor":"The screen exists so this doesn't happen. You opened it."},
    "is-gale-cut": {"name":"Herald's Cut","description":"The wind trapped in the beacon leaves as a single blade and cuts straight through the whole line, pushing each body it cut two steps.","flavor":"Arrives, cuts and is already somewhere else. Copy it."},
    "is-bone-toll": {"name":"Bone Toll","description":"The lantern strikes a deep note the Drowned Court recognizes: anyone two tiles away takes a beating and spends two turns unable to look at anyone else.","flavor":"They still answer roll call. They always do."},
    "is-long-wick": {"name":"Long Fuse","description":"Sticks a lit mine fuse into the target: the initial burn is small, but the fuse keeps burning down inside it for three turns.","flavor":"A long fuse is for those with time to walk away."},
    "is-cinder-wake": {"name":"Ember Trail","description":"The censer swings a full turn and drops a ring of embers two tiles from the body: it catches whoever was approaching, not whoever already arrived.","flavor":"Burns the outer circle. The inner one is your problem."},
    "is-cinco-selos": {"name":"The Five Seals","description":"Stamps all five seals on the ground at once: the mark burns everyone in the circle and keeps burning for two turns — no element puts it out, because it belongs to all.","flavor":"The Collector doesn't sell. He returns."}
  },
  "petSpells": {
    "pet-ember-breath": {"name":"Ember Puff","description":"The little dragon puffs out its chest, shuts its eyes tight and spits a short jet of embers that keeps burning afterward.","flavor":"It thinks it made a lot of noise. It did."},
    "pet-vine-chomp": {"name":"Chomp","description":"The carnivorous plant clamps its mouth on the enemy's ankle and won't let go: whoever was bitten doesn't move this turn.","flavor":"Chews slowly. Savoring it."},
    "pet-gale-buffet": {"name":"Wing Lash","description":"The eagle dives, beats its wings once a hand's breadth from the enemy's face and pushes it back two tiles.","flavor":"Its wind has opinions about where you should be."},
    "pet-dew-mend": {"name":"Sprinkle","description":"The little water creature squeezes itself like a sponge and sprinkles clean water on the most wounded ally.","flavor":"Gets a bit smaller afterward. Refills on its own."},
    "pet-dew-rinse": {"name":"Rinse","description":"Pours itself entirely over the ally and carries off the poison and the roots that held them.","flavor":"Don't ask where what it washes away goes."},
    "pet-guide-hum": {"name":"Guide Buzz","description":"The Pedrinha-Guia hums a note only the ally hears: their strikes land truer and sooner.","flavor":"Always points at danger. That's its flaw."},
    "pet-shard-ward": {"name":"Shield Chip","description":"The Caco Vivo shatters on purpose and the splinters orbit the ally like a short dome.","flavor":"It reassembles next turn. Complaining."},
    "pet-shard-echo": {"name":"Split Echo","description":"Looses an echo of the Broken Heart that hits the enemy and leaves a glowing crack where everything hurts more.","flavor":"The sound of a room much bigger than this one."},
    "pet-selo-clarao": {"name":"Seal Flash","description":"The little critter raises the seal it carries and turns it on the enemy: the white flash pushes one step and collects the rest.","flavor":"It doesn't bite. It enforces the debt."}
  },
  "fusionSpells": {
    "fus-trap-arrow": {"name":"Quiver Spike","description":"The hunting trap fires from below and pins the foot of whoever stepped on it.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-trap-hex": {"name":"Runic Seal","description":"The seal drawn on the ground lights up when stepped on and keeps gnawing afterward.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-trap-bloom": {"name":"Living Pen","description":"Tendrils close the pen around the intruder's ankle.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-trap-venom": {"name":"Pitch Thorn","description":"An invisible thorn left in the shadow: goes in easy and takes long to come out.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-turret-shot": {"name":"Totem Lead","description":"The totem fires both barrels on its own at anyone who enters range.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-effigy-hex": {"name":"Effigy Plague","description":"The effigy points its wax finger and marks the target for the fusion.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-warden-mend": {"name":"Flowerguard's Watering","description":"The flower guard spills warm sap on the most wounded ally.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-shade-cut": {"name":"Twin's Cut","description":"The pitch twin cuts sideways and vanishes before the reply.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."},
    "fus-idol-slam": {"name":"Idol's Brace","description":"The brace idol drops its stone arm and makes room.","flavor":"The work of one body that used to be two."}
  },
  "monsters": {
    "thorn-lasher": {"name":"Lasher","description":"A plant whip rooted in a cracked pot, covered in barbs and dead flowers. Doesn't move — doesn't need to.","flavor":"Turret with petals."},
    "pollen-puff": {"name":"Pollen Toad","description":"A ball of yellow pollen with twig legs and a stitched smile. Walks toward you, swaying. That should be a warning.","flavor":"Kill it from afar. Please, kill it from afar."},
    "burr-mother": {"name":"Mother Burr","description":"A tangle of barbs the size of a dog, with dozens of tiny black eyes among the spines. When it dies, it unravels into two smaller, equally spiteful tangles.","flavor":"One body, three positioning problems."},
    "lantern-wasp": {"name":"Gleamwasp","description":"A wasp the size of a cat whose abdomen is a glass lantern with a light trapped inside. Fast, bright, venomous: arrives first and leaves before the reply.","flavor":"The light it carries once belonged to someone."},
    "sap-shaman": {"name":"Sapper","description":"A hunched tree stump with a face carved by pocketknife and a cauldron of bubbling sap in its lap. Waters allies like tending a garden — and the garden bites.","flavor":"In the rain it sings. Kill it before the chorus."},
    "dew-strider": {"name":"Dew Spider","description":"A spider with thread-thin legs that walks on water pooled on leaves without sinking a millimeter. Weaves with dew: the webs shine, grow heavy and harden.","flavor":"It weighs less than the drop it steps on."},
    "sprout-feral": {"name":"Hungry Sprout","description":"A freshly germinated seedling that is all leaves, haste and teeth. The Gardener plants them; they do the rest.","flavor":"Grows fast because it doesn't plan to last."},
    "burrlet": {"name":"Burrlet","description":"Half the spite, double the speed. Sticks and won't let go.","flavor":"You'll find one in your pocket weeks later."},
    "boss-gardener": {"name":"The Widow Gardener","description":"The Greenhouse's guardian: a three-meter figure of trellis, leather gloves and a widow's veil, with a rusty pruning shear where the hands should be. Still tends the garden. You're the weed.","flavor":"GIMMICK — THE PRUNING: the vine pulls you into the bandstand, the shears trim, the sowing restocks the weeds. The Crown of Thorns punishes the ring 2 tiles away: the safest place in the world is right up against her."},
    "drowned-porter": {"name":"Drownling","description":"A cistern porter who never let go of his lantern. Gray-green skin swollen with water, algae for hair. Bites to drink the warmth he lost.","flavor":"Dueling him is feeding him."},
    "moray-piper": {"name":"Flute Moray","description":"A two-meter eel whose pierced skull whistles when it breathes. Rises from the water like a question mark, spits jets in a straight line and hooks prey with its harpoon tongue.","flavor":"Plays one note, and it's about you."},
    "lantern-jelly": {"name":"Gleamjelly","description":"A jellyfish the size of a chandelier, floating a hand's breadth off the ground, tentacles like crystal fringe. Its light heals the drowned — put it out first.","flavor":"Turns drownlings into sponges."},
    "brine-golem": {"name":"Brinemaw","description":"A colossus of salt crystallized in layers, with a dark water heart visible in its chest. Slow as low tide, unstoppable as high tide. The more it breaks, the sharper it gets.","flavor":"Ignoring it is a countdown."},
    "fat-drop": {"name":"Fat Drop","description":"A drop of water the size of a barrel, with a sleepy face floating inside. Burst it and it becomes two smaller, much more awake drops.","flavor":"Each new drop clogs one more gap."},
    "droplet": {"name":"Droplet","description":"Small, round, indignant.","flavor":"Has strong opinions about your ankle."},
    "sump-crab": {"name":"Sinkhole Crab","description":"A crab the size of a table, with a stone carapace crusted in salt and a disproportionate claw it drags along the floor. Lives in the drain where the cistern empties — and considers that private property.","flavor":"Impossible to push. It already chose its spot."},
    "mist-warbler": {"name":"Mist Hummer","description":"A featherless bird made of the steam rising from still water, with a long beak through which the cistern whistles. Sings to the drowned and blows the living into the channels.","flavor":"Its echo arrives before it does."},
    "boss-baroness": {"name":"Baroness Salmoura","description":"The cistern's mistress: a ballgown from the last century filled with dark living water, with a pearl necklace floating where a neck should be. Receives guests by pulling them close — and swallowing the whole room.","flavor":"GIMMICK — THE BALL: Hungry Tide drags the whole room to her; next turn, Bitter Gulp devours whoever stayed close. Spread out, get pulled, leave before the gulp."},
    "ember-imp": {"name":"Brand","description":"A burning coal with thin arms and a cracked grin of orange light. Runs at you laughing. The laugh is the fuse.","flavor":"Where it dies matters more than when."},
    "walking-anvil": {"name":"Walking Anvil","description":"A centuries-old anvil that grew squat legs and a grudge proportional to the hammer blows it took. Impossible to push; terrible idea to let it come close.","flavor":"Slow as old guilt."},
    "ash-wraith": {"name":"Ashen","description":"The outline of an ancient smith drawn in suspended soot, with two embers for eyes. Fires ash arrows and dissolves into thin air when threatened.","flavor":"Vanishes in the gale and returns at your nape."},
    "slag-mound": {"name":"Slag Heap","description":"A pile of forge scrap that learned to drag itself, leaving a vitrified trail. Break it and it collapses into two glowing slaglets — which explode.","flavor":"The worst thing to kill in tight quarters."},
    "faceless-smith": {"name":"Faceless Smith","description":"A leather apron and two muscled arms hanging from nothing: where a body should be, only shimmering heat. Tempers allies like blades and covers them in burning plates.","flavor":"The support that turns a minion into a problem."},
    "quench-hound": {"name":"Temper Hound","description":"A hound of condensed steam born in the pit where blades were dipped still red. Its fur drips, its bite hisses, and wherever it goes the embers go out — even those of the house's owners.","flavor":"The only water in the Lock, and it bites."},
    "chain-hauler": {"name":"Chain Puller","description":"A forge crane that developed a will: an iron reel hanging from the ceiling rail, with three chains it throws like hooks. Chases no one — brings everyone to it.","flavor":"Anchored to the rail: pushing won't work."},
    "spark-whelp": {"name":"Spark","description":"A spark with legs and opinions. Lives briefly, ends loudly.","flavor":"Magno makes them without looking."},
    "slag-bit": {"name":"Slaglet","description":"A shard of still-red slag, crawling with purpose.","flavor":"Act two of three."},
    "boss-heartforge": {"name":"Magno, the Kindler","description":"The heart of the last Lock in titan form: a four-meter wood furnace with a grate in its chest, a chimney-hammer on its shoulder and the world's first flame burning inside. It doesn't guard the gate. It IS the gate.","flavor":"GIMMICK — THE MARKED PIECE: it marks you with ember (up to 5 stacks), blows you away with the furnace and collects everything at once with Anvil's Verdict. Clear the mark or die for the total."},
    "plank-shrike": {"name":"Plank Shrike","description":"A gray bird with a curved beak that impales its prey on exposed plank nails. Lives in the gaps, drops in free fall and vanishes before you turn your head.","flavor":"Its pantry is the handrail."},
    "gust-gremlin": {"name":"Gust Gremlin","description":"A critter with huge ears that it uses as sails. Doesn't hit to kill: hits to watch you fall. Has a documented bad sense of humor.","flavor":"It counts the falls. Out loud."},
    "rope-hanger": {"name":"Hangman","description":"A tangle of work ropes tied in a knot no one can undo, hanging from the master pulley. Never comes down. Throws nooses and reels in what it caught like hauling material.","flavor":"Fixed to the pulley: a push doesn't move a knot."},
    "kite-serpent": {"name":"Cask Wyrm","description":"A long flat serpent made of waxed paper and slats, with a ribbon tail lined with ground glass. Rides the air currents and drops down slashing.","flavor":"A kite that learned to pull its own string."},
    "ballast-golem": {"name":"Ballast Golem","description":"A beam frame full of gravel sacks, built to hold the scaffold in place when the shaft blows. It held for a thousand years. Now it walks — slowly, and always against the wind.","flavor":"The gale kills it 5 HP per turn. Don't rush it."},
    "whistle-choir": {"name":"Whistle Choir","description":"A bundle of vent pipes tied with wire, floating sideways. Each pipe whistles a note; together they patch up their companions and clear off everything that sticks.","flavor":"Silence the music before arguing with the band."},
    "mote-swarm": {"name":"Mote Swarm","description":"A compact cloud of glowing dust critters that moves as one body. Hit hard enough and it stops being one body — becomes two.","flavor":"You don't kill a cloud. You divide it."},
    "mote-bit": {"name":"Moteling","description":"Half a cloud, double the haste. When it comes apart, the dust briefly catches fire.","flavor":"Dust explodes too. Ask any miner."},
    "nail-sprite": {"name":"Nail Imp","description":"A fifteen-centimeter nail with two tiny eyes and lots of conviction. Cambota drives them into the frame and they walk off.","flavor":"Born crooked, goes in straight."},
    "boss-windwright": {"name":"Cambota, the Foreman","description":"The foreman who never delivered the job: a skeleton of beams and rigging with a pulley for a head and an eternal plumb bob swinging from his arm. Builds the scaffold while fighting atop it — and drops the whole wing if that's faster.","flavor":"GIMMICK — THE WORK GOES ON: rivets mark you (up to 5 stacks), Headwind returns the gale when the weather cools, and Collapse the Wing sends anyone marked 3 tiles into the void. He doesn't need to kill you: he needs to push you."},
    "pick-revenant": {"name":"Pickaxe Haunt","description":"The night shift never came up. The gesture remains: a miner of compacted dust still hitting the same wall, at the same rhythm, for a thousand years. Hits you with the same technique — looking for where it cracks.","flavor":"Marks first. Collects later."},
    "firedamp-wisp": {"name":"Firedamp Blaze","description":"A silent blue flame floating at chest height, the size of a head. It's the mine's gas that developed a will. Doesn't chase: waits for you to enter the wrong gallery.","flavor":"Kill it from afar. Then remember that again."},
    "cave-jaw": {"name":"Bocarra","description":"A stretch of gallery that became a beast: ten meters of tunnel with stalactite teeth and an acquired taste for helmeted meat. Sits still until you think it's a path.","flavor":"The mine's tank. And the door too."},
    "crystal-chanter": {"name":"Crystal Singer","description":"A quartz cluster the size of a man, grown inside an abandoned helmet. Vibrates on a low, steady note that stitches its companions' stone back together.","flavor":"Hitting him is hitting yourself, delayed."},
    "sinkhole-worm": {"name":"Cave-in Worm","description":"A circular mouth of rings that lives under the loose floor and shows only the funnel. Doesn't walk: rearranges the ground until you arrive by gravity.","flavor":"Anchored in bedrock: nothing pushes it."},
    "ore-tumbler": {"name":"Ore Roller","description":"A ball of raw ore the size of a minecart, smooth from rolling along the rails. Gains momentum in a straight line and has no plan for after that.","flavor":"Break it and it becomes two slopes."},
    "ore-chip": {"name":"Vein Splinter","description":"An ore shard with a vein of metal shining in the middle, rolling with purpose.","flavor":"Small, dense and brakeless."},
    "shaft-bat": {"name":"Pit Bat","description":"Thin leather wings stretched over bones too long, with a screech that makes dust draw the shape of the tunnel. Lives in the vertical shaft and descends in a spiral.","flavor":"The only one here hurt by the tremor. It hasn't figured that out yet."},
    "damp-seeper": {"name":"Runoff","description":"A vertical puddle that runs up the wall against gravity, loaded with dissolved mineral. Dissolves shields the way it dissolved the rock it crossed.","flavor":"Mine water quenches nobody's thirst."},
    "boss-deepknock": {"name":"Batepedra, Who Knocks Below","description":"The thing the miners heard knocking on the other side of the wall and pretended was an echo. It's bigger than the gallery it's in: a bedrock torso with two fists of waste rock and no face to search for intent. It knocks. The world answers.","flavor":"GIMMICK — THE THREE KNOCKS: The Knock punishes the ring 2 tiles away (right up against him is safe), Collapse punishes whoever backs off, and Tremor Stance returns the weather that heals it. Either you pull it out of the Tremor, or you learn to fight on top of it."},
    "cinder-herald": {"name":"Ember Herald","description":"One of the four pieces of the Heart that took on a body. This one is an empty armor with a lit slit in its chest, sowing embers on the ground like preparing the house for guests.","flavor":"It doesn't chase. It prepares the ground."},
    "tide-herald": {"name":"Tide Herald","description":"The same armor, filled with dark moving water. Heals its siblings and rearranges the field with short, precise undertows.","flavor":"As long as it lives, the other three don't die properly."},
    "stone-herald": {"name":"Foundation Herald","description":"The armor filled with foundation: stone, lime and a thousand years of stubbornness. Stands between you and the rest of the room and considers it honest work.","flavor":"Taunts, endures and doesn't budge."},
    "gale-herald": {"name":"Gale Herald","description":"The truly empty armor — only the wind inside keeps it standing, and the wind is in a hurry. Arrives, cuts and is already somewhere else.","flavor":"Hard to lock, worse to hit."},
    "null-warden": {"name":"Null Warden","description":"The leftover employee: a gray figure in an apron, with no element at all, that erases others' protections and patches its siblings'. No weather helps it; no weather hinders it.","flavor":"The Heart's answer to those who hid behind shields."},
    "mirror-twin": {"name":"Mirror Twin","description":"A mirror shard the size of a person that walks sideways and shows, one turn late, your own silhouette hitting you. Breaking it only creates more reflective surfaces.","flavor":"Hitting hard is the worst idea available."},
    "mirror-sliver": {"name":"Mirror Shard","description":"A smaller, sharper shard with half your face still trapped in its surface.","flavor":"When it shatters, it cuts those nearby."},
    "weather-mote": {"name":"Mote of Time","description":"A little ball of compressed air the size of a fist, spinning slowly, with a scrap of old sky trapped inside. It's what's left of the old world's weather — and it plays with it.","flavor":"GIMMICK: it changes the room's weather by itself. Your elemental choice becomes a lottery."},
    "heartroot": {"name":"Heartroot","description":"A thick root that came out of the wall and crossed the hall to embrace the Heart and keep it stuck together. It failed. Keeps trying, and grabs anything that passes close.","flavor":"Truly rooted: don't push, cut."},
    "boss-riftheart": {"name":"The Broken Heart","description":"The last Heart of the buried world, cracked into four quarters that still beat out of rhythm — one of ember, one of water, one of stone, one of air. Each beat throws the whole room into a different weather. It doesn't guard the Lock: it IS what's left of the sky, and it's dying loudly.","flavor":"GIMMICK — THE FOUR SEASONS: each turn it beats a different quarter and SWITCHES THE WEATHER along with the strike. The element that healed you starts killing you 5 by 5 HP. Winning means playing with the enemy's weather — and Darn the Rift before it does."},
    "sporeling": {"name":"Sporeling","description":"A baby mushroom with eyes too big and loyalty even bigger. Bites, poisons and, when it falls, bursts into a vengeful cloud of spores.","flavor":"Body, delayed damage and tile denial in one package."},
    "sum-familiar": {"name":"Familiar","description":"A small nameless critter the summoner has called since day one: four legs, crooked teeth and a loyalty nobody asked for. An extra body to bite, tank and block the way.","flavor":"He never says the beast's name. Says a name is a commitment."},
    "sum-ember-hound": {"name":"Ember Hound","description":"A hound of lit charcoal, lean and fast, with a seam of fire running from muzzle to tail. Bites hot and, when it falls, returns the last ember to whoever is nearby.","flavor":"Wags its tail. The tail lights the floor."},
    "sum-magma-colossus": {"name":"Magma Colossus","description":"Four meters of molten rock held in a shape that vaguely resembles a body. Walks slowly because each step opens a fissure, and the heat it gives off dries the whole room.","flavor":"The Heart of the Ember Lock has an older brother. (Level 30 summon.)"},
    "sum-tide-nymph": {"name":"Tide Nymph","description":"A silhouette of clean water, child-sized, that floats a hand's breadth above the ground and goes straight to whoever is bleeding. Never attacks; that's not what it was called for.","flavor":"She never speaks. Just looks at whoever is bleeding and handles it."},
    "sum-stone-sentinel": {"name":"Stone Sentinel","description":"A vertical block of rock with two grooves for eyes, planted wherever the summoner says. Slow, hard and stubborn: exists so a corridor stops being a corridor.","flavor":"Stays where it's put. The most reliable thing in the buried world."},
    "sum-mountain-golem": {"name":"Mountain Golem","description":"An entire hillside that agreed to stand up and take a few steps. Has dead trees on its back and a vein of water running down its shoulder. Nothing in the buried world is harder.","flavor":"He didn't summon the mountain. He just asked if it was up for it. (Level 30 summon.)"},
    "sum-drowned-cistern": {"name":"Drowned of the Cistern","description":"A tall, drenched body with slumped shoulders, made of dark water that doesn't run. Where a face should be there's a void, and inside the torso others can be guessed: hands, shoulders, half a face pressed against the surface from within. No one managed to count how many there are.","flavor":"The cistern returns what it swallowed. Never one at a time."},
    "sum-storm-eye": {"name":"Eye of the Tempest","description":"A figure standing with arms open, wrapped in a spiral of wind that rises from the floor and widens above the head. The face is serene and looks down. The feet stay where they were put: it doesn't walk, and everything that comes close is sent back.","flavor":"In the middle of the storm there's a still place. That's where he lives."},
    "sum-storm-falcon": {"name":"Storm Falcon","description":"A falcon with gray feathers and old lightning caught among them. Flies in tight circles over the battle and dives when it decides, not when told.","flavor":"There's no sky for it to fly in. Flies anyway, out of spite."},
    "colosso_fogo": {"name":"Ember Colossus","description":"A mountain of volcanic rock walking upright, cracked from top to bottom; live lava runs through the fissures. Each step leaves the tile ablaze behind it, and whoever steps there gets burned.","flavor":"The Pit's floors keep the heat wherever it passed."},
    "colosso_agua": {"name":"Tide Colossus","description":"A body of coral and jellyfish, bigger than two men, dripping without ever drying. Where it stops a puddle forms, and standing in it it rebuilds itself.","flavor":"Take it out of the water and it's just wet rock."},
    "colosso_terra": {"name":"Rock Colossus","description":"A stone giant wearing a cuirass of slabs. While the cuirass holds, no blow lands in full; the wind strips it faster than any blade.","flavor":"Cuirass first. Then the rest."},
    "colosso_ar": {"name":"Gale Colossus","description":"A tall figure wrapped in iron chains, and in each chain a trapped wind howling. Moves more than the other colossi, and whoever strikes it up close is blown far away.","flavor":"Getting close to it costs double: going and coming back."},
    "el_fogo_1": {"name":"Wick Watcher","description":"A tall, thin figure in a tattered robe. The head is a stub of melted candle with a single eye in the wax, and the wick has been out for a thousand years. Sees in the dark of the Extinguished Chamber and shoots from afar at those who can't see it.","flavor":"GIMMICK: it sees you in the dark; you only see it from 2 tiles away, or in brazier light."},
    "el_fogo_2": {"name":"Ash Moth","description":"A child-sized moth with a furry, ash-gray body and wings where its arms should be. It circles the braziers and dives at whoever the light reveals. Fast, frail and hard to hold.","flavor":"In the dark it sees as far as you do: 2 tiles."},
    "el_agua_1": {"name":"Sluice Snail","description":"An upright, heavy snail whose shell is a riveted bronze sluice gate. It plants itself on the bridge and hits anyone trying to cross into the water. Water does not slow it.","flavor":"The bridge is dry. With it on top, the bridge is its."},
    "el_agua_2": {"name":"Gallery Heron","description":"A fishing heron standing like a person, with long legs and a harpoon beak. It walks shallow water like dry ground and harpoons from afar anyone the water slowed, or drags them in.","flavor":"A flooded tile costs you 2 MP and its owner 1."},
    "el_terra_1": {"name":"Bollard","description":"A piece of living pillar that stood up and walked off: a fluted column trunk, a capital head with an ancient face, arms of stacked drums. Heavy and rooted. Nothing pushes it.","flavor":"It is the hall in miniature: it rises, falls and never leaves its place."},
    "el_terra_2": {"name":"Sentinel Mole","description":"A stocky mole in a stone helmet, with spade claws bigger than its head. It vanishes into the floor and erupts at the feet of whoever thought they were far.","flavor":"It charges in a straight line: the pillar rising in its path is your shield."},
    "el_ar_1": {"name":"Weathervane","description":"A tall, thin automaton of riveted bronze plates, with a vaned helm for a head and spade hands. It blows from afar and pushes like the terrace gust pushes.","flavor":"On the Gale Terrace its blow reaches one tile farther. So does your Air spell."},
    "el_ar_2": {"name":"Gust Ray","description":"A standing ray: flat diamond body, wide wings where the arms should be, tail hanging down its back like a cape. It glides on the terrace wind and arrives before the warning.","flavor":"The gust pushes it like it pushes you. It just likes it more."}
  },
  "ecoMonstros": {
    "eco_primordial": {"name":"The Primordial Echo","description":"The first voice of the buried world. A colossus assembled from pieces of the six dungeons (crystal, coral, rock, lava and wind bound in chains) with a core pulsing in its chest. It does not walk: the world turns around it.","flavor":"Every 25% of HP lost, a new element; every big strike, warned on the floor a round ahead."},
    "eco_menor_fogo": {"name":"Lesser Ember Echo","description":"A chunk of lava that broke off the Echo and grew legs. It keeps its distance and throws what is its own.","flavor":"Summoned at the Primordial Echo's phase change."},
    "eco_menor_agua": {"name":"Lesser Coral Echo","description":"A coral branch of the Echo, full of water that never drains. It splashes whoever comes close.","flavor":"Summoned at the Primordial Echo's phase change."},
    "eco_menor_terra": {"name":"Lesser Rock Echo","description":"A block from the Echo's shoulder that fell and stood up. Slow, heavy, and it won't move aside.","flavor":"Summoned at the Primordial Echo's phase change."},
    "eco_menor_ar": {"name":"Lesser Wind Echo","description":"A thread of wind caught in the Echo's chains, loosed for a moment. Fast and hard to pin down.","flavor":"Summoned at the Primordial Echo's phase change."}
  },
  "fusionSummons": {
    "fus-arrow-turret": {"name":"Fuse Totem","description":"A hunting totem with one awake eye and two barrels coming out of its mouth: it turns slowly, always aims and never walks."},
    "fus-hex-effigy": {"name":"Runic Effigy","description":"A wax-and-chalk doll with runes written backward. It points a finger and the target feels the finger."},
    "fus-bloom-warden": {"name":"Flower Guard","description":"A flower bud the size of a dog, with petals shaped like cupped hands. It waters whoever bleeds."},
    "fus-shade-twin": {"name":"Pitch Twin","description":"The fusion's shadow peeled off the floor, with half a blade and no face. It walks half a step ahead of the original."},
    "fus-bulwark-idol": {"name":"Brace Idol","description":"Half a pillar carved with the faces of the two fused classes. It stands in the way. That is its whole job."},
    "fus-wall-watcher": {"name":"Watch Wall","description":"A chunk of wall standing upright, with a vertical slit where two eyes watch. Shut, it is a wall; open, it owns the passage."}
  },
  "dungeons": {
    "greenhouse": {"name":"The Buried Greenhouse","description":"The royal greenhouse of the old world, sealed with the garden still alive inside. Centuries in the dark taught the plants to hunt; fireflies trapped in vials stand in for the sun. The water the great Lousa trapped above drips through the cracked glass all night, and the garden loves it."},
    "greenhouse/rooms/0": {"name":"The Ivy Vestibule"},
    "greenhouse/rooms/1": {"name":"The Sunken Flowerbeds"},
    "greenhouse/rooms/2": {"name":"The Widow's Bandstand"},
    "cistern": {"name":"The Cistern of the Drowned","description":"The reservoir that quenched the old world's thirst, then drank its owners. The drowned court still holds balls in the still water: pearls in the mud, submerged lamps still lit, jellyfish chandeliers. Everything reflects, and sometimes the reflection moves first."},
    "cistern/rooms/0": {"name":"The Gallery of Leaks"},
    "cistern/rooms/1": {"name":"The Hall of Salt Columns"},
    "cistern/rooms/2": {"name":"The Salmoura Throne"},
    "emberlock": {"name":"The Ember Lock","description":"The last Lock, forged around the world's first flame. Corridors of cold anvils, chains hanging from the ceiling, light coming from below, from the floor grates. Heat rises and stays: here drought is not weather, it is architecture. The greatest gate ever built woke up jealous of its own fire."},
    "emberlock/rooms/0": {"name":"The Ember Corridor"},
    "emberlock/rooms/1": {"name":"The Nave of Hammers"},
    "emberlock/rooms/2": {"name":"The Heart Chamber"},
    "windscaffold": {"name":"The Wind Scaffolds","description":"The maintenance shaft the builders never finished: fifteen floors of rope-lashed scaffolding hanging over a void no one measured. The buried world's vents all open here, and wind climbs the shaft all night, making the planks sing. Falling is not a tactical defeat. It is the room's floor not existing."},
    "windscaffold/rooms/0": {"name":"The Crane Walkway"},
    "windscaffold/rooms/1": {"name":"The Service Shaft"},
    "windscaffold/rooms/2": {"name":"The Foreman's Bridge"},
    "quakemine": {"name":"The Trembling Mine","description":"The mine that dug upward, trying to pierce the great Lousa from below. It stopped when the night shift never came up. Since then the rock knocks by itself from time to time and dust falls in curtains: the Lousa settling another hand's width. The miners keep working. No one had the courage to tell them the shift is over."},
    "quakemine/rooms/0": {"name":"The Night Shift Gallery"},
    "quakemine/rooms/1": {"name":"The Vent"},
    "quakemine/rooms/2": {"name":"Batepedra's Face"},
    "brokenheart": {"name":"The Broken Heart","description":"The Heart that held up the whole world, not just one Lock. It cracked into four quarters that beat out of rhythm (one of ember, one of water, one of stone, one of air) and each beat throws the room into a different weather. No element is safe here: what healed you three rounds ago is killing you now. This is the end of the Descent, and the Lousa is listening."},
    "brokenheart/rooms/0": {"name":"The Atrium of Four Seasons"},
    "brokenheart/rooms/1": {"name":"The Mirror Room"},
    "brokenheart/rooms/2": {"name":"The Broken Heart"}
  },
  "especiais": {
    "elementsanctum": {"name":"The Sanctuary of the Elements","description":"Before the world was buried, the four elements were taught here, each in its own room: the chamber where only embers see, the gallery the tide fills and empties, the hall of walking pillars and the terrace where the wind never stops. The sanctuary still gives the same lesson, now to whoever descends, and without asking if they want to learn."},
    "elementsanctum/rooms/0": {"name":"The Extinguished Chamber"},
    "elementsanctum/rooms/1": {"name":"The Flooded Gallery"},
    "elementsanctum/rooms/2": {"name":"The Hall of Living Pillars"},
    "elementsanctum/rooms/3": {"name":"The Gale Terrace"},
    "elementsanctum/rooms/4": {"name":"The Altar of the Four"}
  },
  "arenas": {
    "praca": {"name":"The Plaza"},
    "praca/rooms/0": {"name":"The World Tree Plaza"},
    "sede": {"name":"The Guild Hall"},
    "sede/rooms/0": {"name":"The Throne Arena"},
    "camara_eco": {"name":"The Echo Chamber"},
    "camara_eco/rooms/0": {"name":"The Echo Chamber"}
  },
  "tileEvents": {
    "ev-might": {"name":"Breath of Valor","description":"A spark of ancient courage trapped in the floor: +25 power for 2 turns.","flavor":"Someone died brave right here. Some is left."},
    "ev-haste": {"name":"Stride Current","description":"A breath from the vents pushes you from behind: +1 MP for 2 turns.","flavor":"The buried world still breathes, sometimes in your favor."},
    "ev-focus": {"name":"Second of Clarity","description":"Time opens a crack: +1 AP this turn.","flavor":"Rare, short and costly. Use it now."},
    "ev-guard": {"name":"Vial Remnants","description":"A shard of ancient protection closes around whoever steps on it: 25 shield.","flavor":"It protected someone for a thousand years. Now it's your turn."},
    "ev-slip": {"name":"Slippery Floor","description":"Moss, salt or sawdust: you can slip out of any lock. +15 dodge for 2 turns.","flavor":"Slipping at the right moment is a whole school."},
    "ev-mystery": {"name":"Surprise","description":"No one knows what the buried world kept in this tile. Step and find out: could be a gift, could be an old bill.","flavor":"The house always collects. Sometimes it pays."},
    "ev-mystery/outcomes/0": {"text":"A breath of the old world fills your chest. Deep heal!"},
    "ev-mystery/outcomes/1": {"text":"The tile gives way and something below bites. Hard."},
    "ev-mystery/outcomes/2": {"text":"Time opens a crack: one extra action this turn."},
    "ev-mystery/outcomes/3": {"text":"A pocket of foul air bursts in your face. This will sting for a while."},
    "ev-mystery/outcomes/4": {"text":"A memory of someone else's strength climbs your legs: +40 power!"},
    "ev-mystery/outcomes/5": {"text":"Old roots close around your ankles without asking."},
    "ev-mystery/outcomes/6": {"text":"A forgotten dome wakes up whole: shield and regeneration."},
    "ev-portal": {"name":"Vent Mouth","description":"A vent mouth sucks in whoever steps on it and spits them out elsewhere on the map.","flavor":"The Breaths used this as a staircase. You'll use it as an escape."},
    "ev-drain": {"name":"Floor Leech","description":"The floor is hungry: it bites the ankle and keeps drinking for 2 turns.","flavor":"A thousand years without visitors make any floor like this."},
    "ev-fountain": {"name":"Stubborn Spring","description":"A spring that never learned the world ended. You drink on your knees.","flavor":"Still clean. Don't ask why."}
  },
  "fusionIdentities": {
    "arqueiro+bruxo": {"name":"Arcane Artillery","line":"Very long-range magic: marks the whole field from afar and detonates the marks in an area."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro": {"name":"Votive Bow","line":"Arrows that pierce the line in a straight shot and return to the fused body every drop they take."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim": {"name":"Shadow Hunter","line":"Shoots from the pitch dark, leaps onto the marked target and executes: invisibility + repositioning + marks."},
    "arqueiro+invocador": {"name":"Living Turret","line":"Plants shooter totems and trap spikes; the shots leap between the pinned."},
    "arqueiro+sumo": {"name":"Flesh Ballista","line":"Siege: heavy projectiles that push, grapnels that pull and an anchor no one can move."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro": {"name":"Pious Plague","line":"Transfusion: everything it takes from the enemy becomes its own life; blessing on one side, rot on the other."},
    "bruxo+espadachim": {"name":"Runic Blade","line":"Blinks across the field leaving explosions at departures and arrivals, with arcane poison on the blade."},
    "bruxo+invocador": {"name":"Trap Sabbath","line":"Ritual: lit seals under the enemy's feet, circles left as ambushes, curse effigies and the weather turned by force."},
    "bruxo+sumo": {"name":"Arcane Colossus","line":"The magic is not cast, it is radiated: everything around the body gets hit, rooted and struck back."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim": {"name":"Dancing Scalpel","line":"Quick cuts with life theft, emergency healing between steps, and it vanishes mid-turn."},
    "curandeiro+invocador": {"name":"Sacred Garden","line":"Plants the seed INSIDE the enemy and the garden collects later: thornbush around, ambush pen, and guardians that heal what's left."},
    "curandeiro+sumo": {"name":"Merciful Bulwark","line":"A wall that heals by hitting: drags the enemy into range, drinks what it tears out and shares the surplus with whoever bleeds."},
    "espadachim+invocador": {"name":"Multiplied Shadow","line":"Its own shadow cuts first; then come the hidden thorns and the pitch twins: poison from three places at once."},
    "espadachim+sumo": {"name":"Titanic Charge","line":"Weight in motion: charges from afar, grabs, spins and throws, and the floor stays marked."},
    "invocador+sumo": {"name":"Living Fortress","line":"A tank that summons: the cry hurts and taunts the whole room, brace idols fall hitting and the rest of the group is covered in shield."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro": {"name":"The Arrow Slit","line":"It shoots and stays covered. The wall is no obstacle to whoever raised it: it is the window it aims through."},
    "bruxo+minotauro": {"name":"The Crater","line":"The explosion leaves a rim. What remains of the area becomes wall."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro": {"name":"The Shelter","line":"The wall heals whoever leans on it. Guarding and caring become the same thing, and this is the most defensive pair in the game."},
    "espadachim+minotauro": {"name":"The Ambush","line":"Vanishes and leaves a wall where it stood. The enemy hits the stone looking for what is no longer there."},
    "invocador+minotauro": {"name":"The Living Wall","line":"There is someone inside the stone. It blocks AND attacks."},
    "minotauro+sumo": {"name":"The Gate","line":"Both in the same place, and no one leaves. The pair that decides where the fight happens."}
  },
  "fusionBlends": {
    "agua+agua": {"affix":"of the Abyss","description":"Two waters added make depth: the whole room turns heavy, dark and wet. Pure element, pure damage."},
    "agua+ar": {"affix":"of Salt","description":"The gale pulls the water into itself: each blow arrives soaked in salt and pushes whoever takes it one more step back."},
    "agua+fogo": {"affix":"of Scalding","description":"Fused rivals don't cancel out: they become steam under pressure. Burns at once and keeps burning after."},
    "agua+neutro": {"affix":"of Murk","description":"Half the body hasn't chosen an element yet: the water carries the blow colorless, and the leftover mud dissolves shields."},
    "agua+terra": {"affix":"of Mud","description":"Water and earth make mud: it weighs on the feet of whoever takes it and sticks the enemy to the ground for a moment."},
    "ar+ar": {"affix":"of the Cyclone","description":"Two airs added don't blow: they spin. The gale becomes the rule of the room."},
    "ar+fogo": {"affix":"of Wildfire","description":"Fire with wind beneath becomes forge breath: the flare lengthens range and the burst throws the target far."},
    "ar+neutro": {"affix":"of Swiftness","description":"With no element set on the other side, what's left is haste: the blow is light, but arrives first and breaks the formation."},
    "ar+terra": {"affix":"of Sand","description":"Fused rivals become a sandstorm: the grit gets into the wound and makes everything after it hurt."},
    "fogo+fogo": {"affix":"of Hell","description":"Two flames added don't split: they become one, bigger, and dry out the air of the whole room."},
    "fogo+neutro": {"affix":"of Charring","description":"One half burns, the other is still raw force: the blow comes out colorless, but hot and without restraint."},
    "fogo+terra": {"affix":"of the Volcano","description":"Molten stone: hits like rock and keeps cooking beneath the armor."},
    "neutro+neutro": {"affix":"of Rawness","description":"Neither has chosen an element yet: the fusion comes out raw, just the two classes, colorless, and the weather calms around it."},
    "neutro+terra": {"affix":"of Brutality","description":"Half stone, half nothing: what's missing in element is made up in weight. Whoever takes it stays where they are."},
    "terra+terra": {"affix":"of the Soil","description":"Two earths added make a fault line: the ground works with the fusion and never stops shaking."},
    "ar+agua": {"affix":"of Salt","description":"The gale pulls the water into itself: each blow arrives soaked in salt and pushes whoever takes it one more step back."},
    "fogo+agua": {"affix":"of Scalding","description":"Fused rivals don't cancel out: they become steam under pressure. Burns at once and keeps burning after."},
    "neutro+agua": {"affix":"of Murk","description":"Half the body hasn't chosen an element yet: the water carries the blow colorless, and the leftover mud dissolves shields."},
    "terra+agua": {"affix":"of Mud","description":"Water and earth make mud: it weighs on the feet of whoever takes it and sticks the enemy to the ground for a moment."},
    "fogo+ar": {"affix":"of Wildfire","description":"Fire with wind beneath becomes forge breath: the flare lengthens range and the burst throws the target far."},
    "neutro+ar": {"affix":"of Swiftness","description":"With no element set on the other side, what's left is haste: the blow is light, but arrives first and breaks the formation."},
    "terra+ar": {"affix":"of Sand","description":"Fused rivals become a sandstorm: the grit gets into the wound and makes everything after it hurt."},
    "neutro+fogo": {"affix":"of Charring","description":"One half burns, the other is still raw force: the blow comes out colorless, but hot and without restraint."},
    "terra+fogo": {"affix":"of the Volcano","description":"Molten stone: hits like rock and keeps cooking beneath the armor."},
    "terra+neutro": {"affix":"of Brutality","description":"Half stone, half nothing: what's missing in element is made up in weight. Whoever takes it stays where they are."}
  },
  "fusionForms": {
    "arqueiro+bruxo/0": {"formName":"Shot","description":"The enchanted bow fires from across the room and leaves on the target a mark the magic knows how to find later."},
    "arqueiro+bruxo/1": {"formName":"Sigil","description":"The arrow bursts in the air and paints a sigil on everyone who stood too close."},
    "arqueiro+bruxo/2": {"formName":"Bolt","description":"An enchanted bolt pierces the whole line and leaves the same mark on each one it hit."},
    "arqueiro+bruxo/3": {"formName":"Shard","description":"A shard of enchanted glass leaps from enemy to enemy, losing force and gaining hatred."},
    "arqueiro+bruxo/4": {"formName":"Blast","description":"The air splits in a fan from the target and part of the marks left earlier burst along with it."},
    "arqueiro+bruxo/5": {"formName":"Judgment","description":"The fusion shuts both eyes at once: every mark left earlier collects its debt at one go."},
    "arqueiro+bruxo/6": {"formName":"Cataclysm","description":"The room's whole horizon becomes a target: it falls, detonates everything marked and marks what's left again."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro/0": {"formName":"Dart","description":"A votive dart in a straight line: what it takes from the enemy returns hot to the fused body."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro/1": {"formName":"Balm","description":"The fusion throws a sealed vial with the tip of the bow: the balm opens on the ally and keeps working."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro/2": {"formName":"Rosary","description":"One rosary bead per enemy in line: what each one collects drips back into the fused body."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro/3": {"formName":"Thread","description":"A thread of light stretched across the enemy line: each body it crosses returns a sip of life."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro/4": {"formName":"Candle","description":"Lights a candle on the floor: the crown of light burns whoever stands at the edge and the heat returns as healing."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro/5": {"formName":"Chalice","description":"The chalice is raised in the middle of the group: closes wounds, hardens skin and washes out what was rotting within."},
    "arqueiro+curandeiro/6": {"formName":"Sacrament","description":"A single, sacramental arrow crosses the whole room in a line: everything it pierces becomes life on the other side."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim/0": {"formName":"Lunge","description":"The fusion closes the distance in a single leap and arrives before the enemy turns their head."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim/1": {"formName":"Veil","description":"The two silhouettes fold into each other and vanish: no one aims at what they can't count."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim/2": {"formName":"Recoil","description":"Hits and is already gone: the fused body slides back before the reprisal arrives."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim/3": {"formName":"Gash","description":"A cut at guard height: opens the target and leaves the opening open for the next shot."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim/4": {"formName":"Trail","description":"Sniffs out the target's trail, marks where it will step and gains breath to arrive first."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim/5": {"formName":"Rend","description":"The blade is thrown and returns tearing from target to target, collecting every opening it left before."},
    "arqueiro+espadachim/6": {"formName":"Epilogue","description":"The hunt ends in an epilogue: appears glued to the target, collects everything marked and vanishes again in the same motion."},
    "arqueiro+invocador/0": {"formName":"Skewer","description":"An arrow thick as a stake pins the enemy to the ground by the foot: it can still attack, but can't leave."},
    "arqueiro+invocador/1": {"formName":"Nest","description":"The fusion drives the totem into the ground and blows: the eye opens and both barrels seek a target."},
    "arqueiro+invocador/2": {"formName":"Picket","description":"Four rows of stakes rise in a cross from the floor and shut the exits of whoever stood in the middle."},
    "arqueiro+invocador/3": {"formName":"Spike","description":"A hunting spike buried tip up, waiting for the wrong step, and the hammer blow that sinks it already scatters splinters nearby."},
    "arqueiro+invocador/4": {"formName":"Moat","description":"Digs a bristling moat and whistles: whoever hears comes to look up close, and sees from the inside."},
    "arqueiro+invocador/5": {"formName":"Swarm","description":"Not an arrow but a swarm: falls on the group and leaps to whoever tries to back away."},
    "arqueiro+invocador/6": {"formName":"Arsenal","description":"The fusion dumps a whole arsenal onto one tile: a totem rises, a spike vanishes into the ground and the delivery blast already punishes the neighbors."},
    "arqueiro+sumo/0": {"formName":"Throw","description":"The fusion hurls whatever is in hand with sumo weight: the target goes two steps back along with its plan."},
    "arqueiro+sumo/1": {"formName":"Grapnel","description":"Arrow with a rope: hooks the hidden shooter in the back and brings it into melee range."},
    "arqueiro+sumo/2": {"formName":"Rocket","description":"A fat rocket rises in an arc and lands where no one wanted: the blast pushes everyone back a step."},
    "arqueiro+sumo/3": {"formName":"Ram","description":"A siege log fired in a line: sweeps the line, pushes everyone together and leaves feet stuck where they stopped."},
    "arqueiro+sumo/4": {"formName":"Counterweight","description":"The fusion throws its body weight forward and plants its feet: whoever is near takes the hit and no one else escapes."},
    "arqueiro+sumo/5": {"formName":"Bastion","description":"The fusion digs in its feet, spreads its arms and becomes a building: whoever wants to pass must shoot it first."},
    "arqueiro+sumo/6": {"formName":"Trebuchet","description":"The whole body becomes a siege machine and dumps a block on the room's far end: what doesn't die flies off and lands rooted."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro/0": {"formName":"Drain","description":"The open hand pulls a warm thread out of the enemy and shoves it into its own chest."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro/1": {"formName":"Vow","description":"A promise spoken in two voices: closes the cut and makes the ally hard to hurt by the same element."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro/2": {"formName":"Hairshirt","description":"Tightens the hairshirt from afar: what the target loses in blood the fusion gains, and the wound keeps working."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro/3": {"formName":"Stigma","description":"A stigma opened on the skin of everyone around the target: eats shield first, flesh after, without hurry."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro/4": {"formName":"Legacy","description":"Collects from everyone around at once and splits what it tore out like an inheritance."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro/5": {"formName":"Offertory","description":"The fusion passes the basket: each enemy in the circle gives a little life, and it all goes to the same place."},
    "bruxo+curandeiro/6": {"formName":"Anathema","description":"Excommunication in two tongues at once: tears off the shield, poisons twice and fattens the fusion with what it took."},
    "bruxo+espadachim/0": {"formName":"Cut","description":"The blade has runes carved up to the hilt: the cut closes, what it wrote inside does not."},
    "bruxo+espadachim/1": {"formName":"Leap","description":"Vanishes from one point and reappears at another; the air closing where it arrived burns whoever was near."},
    "bruxo+espadachim/2": {"formName":"Scratch","description":"A rune scratch cutting the whole line, and the ink left in the wound never stops burning."},
    "bruxo+espadachim/3": {"formName":"Stiletto","description":"A stiletto too thin to be seen, dipped in a spell with no known antidote."},
    "bruxo+espadachim/4": {"formName":"Furrow","description":"The blade opens a fan-shaped furrow in the floor and the poison runs along it until it finds a bare foot."},
    "bruxo+espadachim/5": {"formName":"Mantle","description":"The runic mantle closes over the two silhouettes: vanishes from the map and returns hitting much harder."},
    "bruxo+espadachim/6": {"formName":"Nightmare","description":"Appears amid the enemy group like a bad dream, breaks up the circle with poison and vanishes before they wake."},
    "bruxo+invocador/0": {"formName":"Seal","description":"The seal is not drawn on the floor: it is drawn UNDER the enemy, and lights at once. Whoever signs never leaves where they signed."},
    "bruxo+invocador/1": {"formName":"Circle","description":"A circle of chalk and ash left closed on the floor, waiting for a careless foot to open it."},
    "bruxo+invocador/2": {"formName":"Yard","description":"Draws a closed yard on the floor: whoever is on the line can't leave until the ritual ends."},
    "bruxo+invocador/3": {"formName":"Choir","description":"The fusion molds a wax effigy with both its faces; the choir's first note leaves the doll and cracks the air around it."},
    "bruxo+invocador/4": {"formName":"Burial","description":"Buries the second trap beside the first and spits on the grave: the ground around already starts to rot."},
    "bruxo+invocador/5": {"formName":"Omen","description":"The ritual calms the room's weather by force, so no one has a weather edge, and the fusion keeps all the air's attention."},
    "bruxo+invocador/6": {"formName":"Sabbath","description":"The full sabbath on one tile: effigy standing, seal lit beneath and a plague opened in a ring to open the party."},
    "bruxo+sumo/0": {"formName":"Thud","description":"The arm comes down with sumo weight and snaps a spell on contact: the thud makes room by force."},
    "bruxo+sumo/1": {"formName":"Halo","description":"A halo of energy opens around the body and pins to the floor the feet of whoever stood too close."},
    "bruxo+sumo/2": {"formName":"Boom","description":"Four shockwaves leave the body in a cross and sweep the room to the wall, pushing what they find."},
    "bruxo+sumo/3": {"formName":"Mirror","description":"The skin becomes an enchanted mirror: part of what hits it returns the same way, with interest."},
    "bruxo+sumo/4": {"formName":"Bellow","description":"A fan-shaped bellow that rips the magic shell off everyone it caught in front."},
    "bruxo+sumo/5": {"formName":"Siege","description":"The colossus inhales and the room comes along: everyone is pulled close, shieldless and already taking hits."},
    "bruxo+sumo/6": {"formName":"Colossus","description":"The fusion stops casting and simply HAPPENS: three tiles of radius of pure arcane impact, shieldless and with no way out."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim/0": {"formName":"Welt","description":"A shallow, exact welt, the way someone who knows how to stitch also knows how to open. Cheap: can be repeated."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim/1": {"formName":"Pulse","description":"Two fingers on the ally's pulse: finds what is wrong and tears it out in the same motion."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim/2": {"formName":"Scrap","description":"Cuts, stitches its own cut and is already a step ahead of the blood that fell."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim/3": {"formName":"Scalpel","description":"Surgical cut between two ribs: takes life, delivers poison and returns health to whoever cut."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim/4": {"formName":"Cadence","description":"Closes the cadence on the target and opens twice: both elements collect in the same turn."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim/5": {"formName":"Breath","description":"The fusion breathes deep just once and gains a full turn of advantage, and vanishes while doing it."},
    "curandeiro+espadachim/6": {"formName":"Carousel","description":"Spins into the middle of the group, opens everyone in a ring, drinks what it opened and leaves by the other side unseen."},
    "curandeiro+invocador/0": {"formName":"Sprout","description":"The seed is not planted in the ground: it is planted in the enemy. It sprouts inside and keeps growing after the blow."},
    "curandeiro+invocador/1": {"formName":"Dew","description":"A warm dew falls over the group: heals little at once and a lot over time."},
    "curandeiro+invocador/2": {"formName":"Nursery","description":"Four flowerbeds sprout in a cross at once, and what grows in them is not for eating."},
    "curandeiro+invocador/3": {"formName":"Pen","description":"The pen of tendrils bursts from the ground to lie in ambush, and the eruption already catches whoever was too near the upturned earth."},
    "curandeiro+invocador/4": {"formName":"Graft","description":"A living graft fixed in the ally's wound: closes the gap and grows bark over it."},
    "curandeiro+invocador/5": {"formName":"Thornbush","description":"The whole garden closes into a thornbush around the fusion: two tiles of radius of living bramble that pierces, poisons and holds by the ankle."},
    "curandeiro+invocador/6": {"formName":"Orchard","description":"Not a spell, a season: the orchard opens over the group, heals, shields, keeps healing and leaves a guard planted."},
    "curandeiro+sumo/0": {"formName":"Bulkhead","description":"The same arm that shelters the ally comes down as a bulkhead on the enemy: what it tears out returns as breath to the fused body."},
    "curandeiro+sumo/1": {"formName":"Call","description":"The rampart calls by name and the enemy obeys: dragged two tiles into range and pays for the trip in HP."},
    "curandeiro+sumo/2": {"formName":"Prop","description":"Leans a shoulder on the ally and becomes their prop: as long as the fusion holds, they don't fall."},
    "curandeiro+sumo/3": {"formName":"Wall","description":"The wall advances a hand's width and everyone around finds out they were too close."},
    "curandeiro+sumo/4": {"formName":"Fold","description":"Shuts the fold: everyone loose at the rim comes inside, taking hits on the way."},
    "curandeiro+sumo/5": {"formName":"Oath","description":"The oath is simple: no one passes today. Taunts the whole room, wears thick shield and returns part of each blow."},
    "curandeiro+sumo/6": {"formName":"Shrine","description":"The fusion opens its arms and the whole group fits inside: deep healing, thick shield, cleansing and hide against the element that hurts most."},
    "espadachim+invocador/0": {"formName":"Figure","description":"The fusion's shadow peels off the floor, slashes past the enemy's side and returns before anyone counts how many bodies were there."},
    "espadachim+invocador/1": {"formName":"Thorn","description":"A thin thorn dropped where the light doesn't reach, with poison saved in its tip."},
    "espadachim+invocador/2": {"formName":"Stinger","description":"The stinger goes in fast and out even faster; what it left inside is what takes time."},
    "espadachim+invocador/3": {"formName":"Strike","description":"The true blow comes from where no one counted a body, and leaves poison to remember it by."},
    "espadachim+invocador/4": {"formName":"Specter","description":"Strikes with the specter's face and vanishes with it: whoever is left has no idea where it came from or where it went."},
    "espadachim+invocador/5": {"formName":"Pitch","description":"The fusion erases itself and lights a twin in its place: now the enemy has to guess which of the two will hurt."},
    "espadachim+invocador/6": {"formName":"Procession","description":"The procession arrives together: a twin in front, poison on the sides and a thorn left on the ground for the way back."},
    "espadachim+sumo/0": {"formName":"Shove","description":"The fusion simply arrives: it crosses the distance at a run and the shoulder lands before the rest."},
    "espadachim+sumo/1": {"formName":"Grab","description":"Grabs by the clothes, drags in close and plants the poor soul's feet in the ground: now the conversation is here."},
    "espadachim+sumo/2": {"formName":"Jolt","description":"Crosses the room in one jolt and delivers the whole shoulder on arrival."},
    "espadachim+sumo/3": {"formName":"Wrench","description":"Lifts the enemy by the torso and hurls it three tiles, preferably at the corner of something."},
    "espadachim+sumo/4": {"formName":"Ricochet","description":"Uses the enemy as a projectile: it flies, hits the others and the damage is split along the way."},
    "espadachim+sumo/5": {"formName":"Whirl","description":"The fusion spins once with arms wide and the whole wheel flies off with it."},
    "espadachim+sumo/6": {"formName":"Impact","description":"Six tiles of run-up and a ton of landing: the ground sinks, the target goes out and the neighbors are trapped in the rubble."},
    "invocador+sumo/0": {"formName":"Cry","description":"Two throats shouting the same thing an inch from everyone's face: the cry hurts those around and forces the whole room to face the fusion."},
    "invocador+sumo/1": {"formName":"Guardian","description":"The fusion tears a piece off its own carapace and drives it into the ground: it becomes an idol, and the impact cracks open the ground under whoever stood beside it."},
    "invocador+sumo/2": {"formName":"Standard","description":"Plants the fusion's standard: whoever fights in the cloth's shadow hits harder and takes less."},
    "invocador+sumo/3": {"formName":"Bulwark","description":"Raises a bulwark around the ally: thick bark and hide against the element hurting most."},
    "invocador+sumo/4": {"formName":"Pillar","description":"A pillar drops from the ceiling and cracks the ground in a cross; the feet of whoever stood in the crack stay stuck in it."},
    "invocador+sumo/5": {"formName":"Ring","description":"The fortress closes the ring: pulls everyone into range and nails their feet where they land."},
    "invocador+sumo/6": {"formName":"Foundation","description":"The fusion becomes a building foundation: a new idol standing beside it, the whole room forced to hit it and every blow coming back by half."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro/0": {"formName":"Hatch","description":"A shot through the crack: marks the target and ducks back behind the stone before it sees where it came from."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro/1": {"formName":"Parapet","description":"Raises the stone ahead and leans on it: rises pushing whoever was pressed against it, holds what comes and the shield holds the rest."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro/2": {"formName":"String","description":"The arrow crosses the whole line and leaves the same mark on everyone in it."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro/3": {"formName":"Crenel","description":"Closes a stone cross around the chosen spot and aims from up there, calmly."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro/4": {"formName":"Riposte","description":"Detonates from afar everything marked, and the surrounding stone throws the blast back inward."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro/5": {"formName":"Bulwark","description":"A ring of stone at a distance, and you in the middle: nobody gets close, and every shot of yours lands deeper."},
    "arqueiro+minotauro/6": {"formName":"Onslaught","description":"Closes the ring around them, detonates every mark at once and marks again whatever is left standing."},
    "bruxo+minotauro/0": {"formName":"Breakers","description":"Blasts the ground in a short radius and pushes out whoever stood too close."},
    "bruxo+minotauro/1": {"formName":"Rim","description":"The blast doesn't open a hole: it raises the rim. A ring of stone where there used to be a path."},
    "bruxo+minotauro/2": {"formName":"Furnace","description":"A whole ray of heat that stays on the ground, burning whoever insists on passing."},
    "bruxo+minotauro/3": {"formName":"Dome","description":"Closes the stone in a wide ring around you and shelters inside it to cast in peace."},
    "bruxo+minotauro/4": {"formName":"Collapse","description":"The stone comes down in a cross: 0 MP on those underneath, and dust in place of the path."},
    "bruxo+minotauro/5": {"formName":"Coliseum","description":"Raises the stands around them and drops the roof inside: trapped, and no audience."},
    "bruxo+minotauro/6": {"formName":"Volcano","description":"Opens the volcano's mouth in radius 3, pushes everything away and seals the rim with its own cooled lava."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro/0": {"formName":"Shelter","description":"Bashes whoever came close with the shield and uses the same motion to close the wound of whoever stood behind."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro/1": {"formName":"Porch","description":"The stone rises pushing whoever was in the way, and the shadow beneath it restores whoever arrives first."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro/2": {"formName":"Apothecary","description":"The flash burns who shouldn't be there and heals who should, in the same radius."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro/3": {"formName":"Cloister","description":"Closes the cloister around you: stone outside, healing inside, three turns of silence."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro/4": {"formName":"Infirmary","description":"Three stones rise in a line: hurts whoever was in it and gives breath back to whoever was behind."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro/5": {"formName":"Hospice","description":"The wave comes from inside the shelter: hurts those besieging and heals and shields those inside."},
    "curandeiro+minotauro/6": {"formName":"Sanctuary","description":"The sanctuary seals: four turns of stone, full heal, shield, regeneration and nothing else gets in."},
    "espadachim+minotauro/0": {"formName":"Feint","description":"Cuts and steps back, leaving the other one striking at nothing."},
    "espadachim+minotauro/1": {"formName":"Swap","description":"Leaves where it stood and puts a stone in its own place. Whoever was coming arrives late."},
    "espadachim+minotauro/2": {"formName":"Alley","description":"Closes the corridor with three stones, crushes whoever was in it and vanishes behind them."},
    "espadachim+minotauro/3": {"formName":"Stab","description":"The blow only someone hidden can land: deep, and the target doesn't budge."},
    "espadachim+minotauro/4": {"formName":"Snare","description":"Closes the ring around the target and cuts while it looks for the exit."},
    "espadachim+minotauro/5": {"formName":"Threshold","description":"Vanishes for two turns, with the stone guarding your back and the blade weighing more."},
    "espadachim+minotauro/6": {"formName":"Maze","description":"Raises the stone cross, vanishes inside it and comes out of the enemy. It never saw how."},
    "invocador+minotauro/0": {"formName":"Sentinel","description":"Drives the idol in where the path needs an owner, and the impact cracks open the ground under whoever stood beside it."},
    "invocador+minotauro/1": {"formName":"Lookout","description":"The stone rises cracking the ground and leaves the noose set at its foot: whoever goes around steps on what stayed hidden."},
    "invocador+minotauro/2": {"formName":"Watch","description":"The idol rises from the ground already shielded, and the jolt of the rise knocks down whoever was on top."},
    "invocador+minotauro/3": {"formName":"Palisade","description":"Three stones rise in a line, hurt whoever was in it, and the roar says the rest: you have to come this way."},
    "invocador+minotauro/4": {"formName":"Hedge","description":"The fence grows in a cross and bites: whoever was inside stays, and bleeds."},
    "invocador+minotauro/5": {"formName":"Garrison","description":"Idol, wall and shield at once, and the ground cracks under whoever was in the passage."},
    "invocador+minotauro/6": {"formName":"Fortress","description":"Closes the ring, drives the idol inside it and drops the rampart on whoever stayed outside: the fortress has garrison, wall and gate."},
    "minotauro+sumo/0": {"formName":"Crash","description":"Two tons arriving at the same time: 0 MP on whoever took it."},
    "minotauro+sumo/1": {"formName":"Bar","description":"Bars the passage with stone and calls the fight to itself: there is only one way, and it is standing in it."},
    "minotauro+sumo/2": {"formName":"Brace","description":"Crosses the line shoving with the shoulder and brings everyone two tiles closer."},
    "minotauro+sumo/3": {"formName":"Corral","description":"Closes the corral around them, hurts whoever hits the stone and glues the ground to their feet for two turns."},
    "minotauro+sumo/4": {"formName":"Headbutt","description":"The fan of horns throws everyone back and pins to the ground whoever is still standing."},
    "minotauro+sumo/5": {"formName":"Redoubt","description":"Plants both feet, calls everyone and returns part of what it takes for three turns."},
    "minotauro+sumo/6": {"formName":"Latch","description":"The stone ring closes, the ground sticks to their feet and the roar says the rest: nobody gets past here."}
  },
  "pets": {
    "pet-emberling": {"name":"Brasinha","description":"A little dragon the size of a fat cat, scales the color of a lit coal with orange edges pulsing as it breathes. Wings too short to really fly, so it mostly makes long leaps and glides. Soft little horns, pale belly, and a permanent wisp of smoke from one nostril only. When it attacks, it puffs out its whole chest and the inner glow leaks through the scale cracks; when idle, it curls up beside its owner like a living brazier."},
    "pet-snapvine": {"name":"Bocarra","description":"A carnivorous plant in a cracked clay pot that it carries around on two root legs. Huge head-mouth, green lips with yellowish spots, white triangular teeth too big for its body and a long red tongue that hangs out when it's happy. Two leaves at the base of the stalk work as eyebrows and give away its mood. It attacks by stretching the stalk in a lunge and biting the ankle, then keeps its mouth shut, chewing, leaves raised in pride."},
    "pet-galehawk": {"name":"Rasga-Ar","description":"A lean eagle with pale gray feathers, tips almost transparent, as if the air were eating its edges. Wingspan wider than a hero is tall, white chest, yellow eyes with no visible eyelid. It always flies a bit above head height and leaves a thin streak of wind behind. In attack it folds its wings, dives and flares everything open an inch from the target: the burst of air is the blow, the talons are just the scare."},
    "pet-dewling": {"name":"Borbulha","description":"A water drop the size of a sitting dog, with a surface tension that ripples when it walks. Inside float three little leaves and a smooth pebble it never explains. No mouth: its eyes are two darker bubbles that rise and fall. It walks hopping with a plop. To heal, it squeezes itself like a sponge and sprays; to cleanse, it pours itself over the ally and reassembles on the ground afterward, a little shorter."},
    "pet-lodestone": {"name":"Pedrinha-Guia","description":"A golem pup the size of a stocky cat, smooth stone with moss in the joints and white crystal eyes full of loyalty. On its chest, a spiral groove with iron dust spins like a living compass, pointing out danger before anyone else. Three little pebbles orbit it like pups. It sits like a dog awaiting orders, and when it blesses someone the spiral pulses with white light."},
    "pet-heartshard": {"name":"Caco Vivo","description":"A little smoked-glass fox the size of a cat, with a multicolored ember heart visibly pulsing in its chest: a shard of the Broken Heart itself that grew a body and grew attached. Its tail ends in loose crystal splinters, and six tiny shards orbit it at different rhythms, like a procession. The heart changes color with the room's weather; when it protects someone, the six shards fire off and form a short dome, then return one by one."},
    "pet-colecionador": {"name":"Selinho","description":"A white lion cub with a golden mane who walks upright, with a gold medallion on its neck: the First Seal in miniature. When happy, it flips the medallion to \"show the other face\". It doesn't bite: it collects."}
  },
  "items": {
    "gh-firefly-crown": {"name":"Firefly Claw","description":"Wire glove with three tiny domes on the knuckles, each holding a live leak firefly in its own puddle. +8 initiative, +3 power.","flavor":"They light up half a second before the punch. Learn from them."},
    "gh-widow-shears": {"name":"Widow's Shears","description":"The Widow Gardener's pruning shears, taller than a child and still sticky with sap. +1 AP, +14 power.","flavor":"She pruned the garden. Now you prune the world."},
    "gh-moss-treads": {"name":"Moss Soles","description":"Sandals lined with living moss that grips wet floors and makes no noise. +8 dodge, +4 initiative.","flavor":"The moss grows back every night. Don't ask from what."},
    "gh-vine-stirrups": {"name":"Ivy Stirrups","description":"Two living ivies wrapped around the shins that push the next step before you ask. +1 MP, +10 dodge.","flavor":"They know where you're going. They rarely disagree."},
    "gh-trellis-guard": {"name":"Trellis Guard","description":"Wooden trellis plate covered in ivy, tied to the chest with greenhouse rope. +15 HP, +5% Earth resistance.","flavor":"The ivy covering you squeezes your arm affectionately."},
    "gh-sap-apron": {"name":"Sap Apron","description":"Gardener's apron soaked in hardened sap, stiff as boiled leather. +30 HP, +10% Earth, +5% Water.","flavor":"The pockets still have seeds. Don't plant any."},
    "gh-seed-pouch": {"name":"Pod Lantern","description":"Glass lantern fueled by bursting pods picked green: they glow green while they ferment and go off with the glass when it opens. Grants the spell Seed Bomb.","flavor":"Shaking is not recommended. Everyone shakes."},
    "gh-briar-charm": {"name":"Bramble Blaze","description":"A knot of gutter bramble that burns without being consumed, held in a wire cage. When its owner is frightened, the flame rises and the thorns close around them. Grants the spell Thorn Vial.","flavor":"Burning for a thousand years and still green inside. Nobody explained."},
    "ci-lantern-fob": {"name":"Drownling Claw","description":"The swollen hand of a court porter, hardened in brine and worn as a glove. Still grabs first and asks later. +10 initiative.","flavor":"It grabs before you decide to grab. Let it."},
    "ci-harpoon-flute": {"name":"Harpoon Flute","description":"Long bone with three flute holes and a barbed tip; whistles low as it cuts the air. +10 power, +5 initiative.","flavor":"Whistles the same low note on every blow: go down."},
    "ci-current-fins": {"name":"Current Membranes","description":"Thin membranes stretched between the toes and fastened at the ankle: each stride pushes the still water as if it agreed. +10 dodge, +4 initiative.","flavor":"They fit on dry land. Nobody understands how."},
    "ci-baroness-collar": {"name":"Baroness's Pumps","description":"Baroness Salmoura's ballroom shoes, with mud-pearl buckles and soles that never touch the bottom. Water makes way ahead of them. +1 MP, +15 HP, +8 initiative, +12 dodge.","flavor":"The tide makes way for whoever wears them. Out of respect, or fear."},
    "ci-brine-cuirass": {"name":"Brine Cuirass","description":"Breastplate of crystallized salt plates, light and sharp at the edges. +20 HP, +8% Water resistance.","flavor":"The more it breaks, the sharper it gets. Like its previous owner."},
    "ci-drowned-coat": {"name":"Porter's Coat","description":"High-collared coat that drips water forever and weighs like an embrace. +35 HP, +12% Water, +5% Fire.","flavor":"Whoever wears it never lets go of what they carry. Mind what you carry."},
    "ci-tide-flask": {"name":"Tide Lantern","description":"Submerged lamp whose flame never knew it drowned. The waterline inside the glass always tilts, and the water outside tilts with it. Grants the spell Undertow.","flavor":"Twice a day the lantern pulls. Nobody knows where to."},
    "ci-jelly-vial": {"name":"Jellyfish Ampoule","description":"Warm ampoule with a living gleamjelly inside, pulsing slowly and lighting three tiles of corridor with each pulse. Grants the spell Gentle Tide.","flavor":"It lights and heals because it thinks you're the aquarium."},
    "em-bellows-valve": {"name":"Bellows Gauntlet","description":"Brass gauntlet with an accordion bellows on the forearm: the fist closes, the valve opens and compressed air arrives before the hand. +12 initiative.","flavor":"The whistle is half a second of advantage. In the Locks, that's a lifetime."},
    "em-forge-grate": {"name":"Maul of the First Fire","description":"Magno's maul, its head hollowed into a grille with live ember trapped between the bars. Every blow breathes. +1 AP, +12 power, +10% Fire.","flavor":"It struck the world's first fire. Not easily impressed."},
    "em-cinder-treads": {"name":"Slag Soles","description":"Soles of cold slag that don't burn on the forge floor and give a push with every stride. +1 MP, +6 initiative, +14 dodge.","flavor":"Walking on embers is a matter of soles, they say."},
    "em-chain-harness": {"name":"Forge Shackles","description":"Chains from the forge ceiling clamped on the ankles: they give a pendulum's swing to dodge and an anchor's weight to hold whoever tries to flee. +12 dodge, +8 lock.","flavor":"They held something before. Now they walk with you, willingly."},
    "em-riveted-plate": {"name":"Riveted Plate","description":"Rectangular plate torn from the forge gate, with four rivets at the corners. +25 HP, +8% Fire.","flavor":"The gate doesn't miss it. Probably."},
    "em-soot-mantle": {"name":"Soot Mantle","description":"Mantle that crumbles into particles at the hem and rebuilds itself while there is smoke in the room. +40 HP, +15% Fire, +5% Air.","flavor":"Sometimes it remembers it used to be someone, and hugs you."},
    "em-ember-flask": {"name":"Spark Lamp","description":"Thick-glass lamp with a restless spark bouncing off the walls inside. It always knows the way back to its owner, and sometimes goes ahead. Grants the spell Ember Leap.","flavor":"It goes first. You go along. Agree beforehand."},
    "em-brand-iron": {"name":"Hot Iron","description":"Branding iron stamped with the Lock's mark at the tip, bright red for a thousand years with no forge nearby. Lights the corridor orange and smells of hot metal. Grants the spell Branding Iron.","flavor":"The Faceless Smith branded everything. Himself included."},
    "av-kite-crest": {"name":"Rod Claw","description":"Five kite rods tied to the fingers with cloth stretched between them: the hand becomes a wing and the blow comes with the current. +14 initiative, +8 power.","flavor":"It pulls upward all the time. You get used to leaning."},
    "av-plank-gauntlet": {"name":"Plank Gauntlet","description":"Scaffold plank tied to the forearm with tarred rope: hits like an oar and holds like a handrail. +14 power, +6 lock.","flavor":"It used to be a floor. It prefers being an argument."},
    "av-glider-cloak": {"name":"Span Spurs","description":"Spurs of rod and cloth that open like a fan with each stride and catch the current rising from the gap: they turn a fall into a step. +1 MP, +12 dodge.","flavor":"On the Scaffolds, falling is just a slow way of walking."},
    "av-updraft-boots": {"name":"Vent Boots","description":"Boots with grilles in the soles that suck in the vents' air and return it from below with each stride. +1 MP, +12 initiative, +14 dodge.","flavor":"They take the step. You only pick the direction."},
    "av-rope-vest": {"name":"Rigging Vest","description":"Vest woven from the scaffolds' rigging, tightened on the chest with sailor's knots. +30 HP, +8% Air.","flavor":"Every knot has a name. Learn two, at least."},
    "av-storm-harness": {"name":"Tempest Harness","description":"Leather harness with brass rings that hum in the gale and keep the body glued to the walkway. +45 HP, +15% Air, +6% Earth.","flavor":"It holds the body. Courage is your problem."},
    "av-wind-whistle": {"name":"Span Lantern","description":"Walkway signal lantern: the flame inside leans toward the current before the current arrives, and if you blow on the glass, the current comes. Grants the spell Puff.","flavor":"The Breathers used it to find the vent. You use it to sweep the walkway."},
    "av-lightning-coil": {"name":"Lightning Coil","description":"Fine wire coil wound on a copper nail, always bristling and lit from within a storm blue that crackles softly. Grants the spell Storm Current.","flavor":"Makes your whole arm tingle before it decides for you."},
    "mt-drill-bit": {"name":"Vein Drill","description":"Helical drill of raw ore, too heavy for one hand and sharpened by friction. +16 power, +8 lock.","flavor":"It dug too deep. That's why the mine trembles."},
    "mt-quake-crown": {"name":"Fault Fist","description":"A block of cracked rock molded around the hand, trembling softly to the mine's rhythm and stopping the instant of impact. +1 AP, +20 HP, +10% Earth.","flavor":"The tremor no longer comes from the ground. It comes from you."},
    "mt-ore-greaves": {"name":"Ore Greaves","description":"Ore shin guards that find solid rock on their own amid the cave-in. +1 MP, +10 lock, +8 dodge.","flavor":"They know where the floor still exists. Trust them."},
    "mt-cart-wheels": {"name":"Minecart Wheels","description":"Two minecart wheels fitted to the heels, good on rails and terrible on stairs. +14 initiative, +12 dodge.","flavor":"Going down is fast. Going down is always fast."},
    "mt-slate-plate": {"name":"Slate Breastplate","description":"Slate chips layered like scales, tied with copper wire. +45 HP, +12% Earth, +6% Water.","flavor":"One chip cracks per blow. Many chips came."},
    "mt-bedrock-carapace": {"name":"Bedrock Carapace","description":"Block dug from the mine's bedrock, molded to its owner's back and heavy as a promise. +55 HP, +18% Earth, +6% Air.","flavor":"The mine lent it. The mine collects later."},
    "mt-quake-nail": {"name":"Plumb Lantern","description":"Lantern hanging on a plumb line: always points down, even when the whole gallery is crooked, and where its light hits the floor, the nail drops. Grants the spell Tremor Nail.","flavor":"The mine lies about where down is. The lantern doesn't."},
    "mt-shoring-charm": {"name":"Shorer's Lamp","description":"The lamp of whoever shored up the ceiling: low flame, scratched glass and a miniature carved beam welded to the handle. Where it is set down, the ore remembers how to stand. Grants the spell Ore Prop.","flavor":"Whoever went down without one didn't come up with stories."},
    "cp-heart-crown": {"name":"Heart Fist","description":"Gauntlet built from the four largest shards of the Broken Heart, one of each element, turning slowly around the fingers without ever touching. +1 AP, +22 power, +10 initiative.","flavor":"Four elements arguing inside your hand. Win the argument."},
    "cp-shard-ring": {"name":"Shard Knuckles","description":"Metal bar for the four fingers with Heart shards driven into the ridges, heating up when the owner decides to hit. +20 power, +8 initiative.","flavor":"It tightens the fingers before the blow. That's how it agrees."},
    "cp-quicksilver-boots": {"name":"Quicksilver Boots","description":"Boots with liquid-metal soles that remake themselves every step and never cool. +1 MP, +16 dodge, +12 initiative.","flavor":"They arrive half a step before you decide to go."},
    "cp-ashen-anklets": {"name":"Ash Anklets","description":"Two hoops of pressed ash that leave a short trail on the ground and confuse whoever tries to follow it. +1 MP, +10 dodge, +8 lock.","flavor":"The trail fades by itself. Always a little too late."},
    "cp-scar-plate": {"name":"Scar Breastplate","description":"Plate patched with thick staples over a crack running through the metal from side to side. +50 HP, +15% Neutral, +6% Fire, +6% Water.","flavor":"It failed once. It doesn't plan to repeat it."},
    "cp-worldshell": {"name":"World Hoof","description":"A piece of the Great Lousa itself, thin as a tile and cold as the sky that turned to stone. +60 HP and +12% resistance to all elements.","flavor":"The sky came down on the world. A chunk of it now comes down on you, from the right side."},
    "cp-heart-horn": {"name":"Ember Horn","description":"Short horn carved from a hollow shard of the Heart, with a live coal lodged in the mouthpiece: blowing lights the coal, and the note is red enough for the whole room to see where it came from. +16 power. Grants the spell Call of the Heart.","flavor":"Calls everyone. Everyone comes. That's the problem and the charm."},
    "cp-eclipse-lens": {"name":"Eclipse Lens","description":"Smoked-glass disc carved from the Broken Heart: the only Lume that, instead of giving light, gathers it. Looking through it, the room's weather becomes a suggestion. Grants the spell Eclipse.","flavor":"Every Lume lights up. This one puts out, and so it's worth two."},
    "gh-wasp-sting": {"name":"Gleamwasp Stinger","description":"A Gleamwasp stinger mounted on a bamboo handle, with a remnant of the abdomen's lantern still stuck at the base. Arrives before the hand. +9 initiative, +4 power.","flavor":"It still blinks. Nobody dared ask why."},
    "gh-pollen-slippers": {"name":"Pollen Slippers","description":"Soles covered in pressed pollen that raise a little yellow cloud with each stride and blur the walker's outline. +9 dodge, +6 initiative.","flavor":"Sneezing gives away your position. Hold it."},
    "gh-chitin-vest": {"name":"Chitin Vest","description":"Plates from the swarm's back sewn into shingles, light as paper and hard as a nail. The wind passes through them finding nothing to push. +18 HP, +8% Air resistance.","flavor":"Weighs less than the shirt you're wearing."},
    "gh-hive-lantern": {"name":"Honeycomb Lantern","description":"A chunk of honeycomb with three live gleamwasps trapped in the cells, glowing yellow through the wax. Opening the little hatch releases all three. Grants the spell Swarm Sting.","flavor":"The light is the rent. They collect the rest on the spot."},
    "gh-dew-fang": {"name":"Dew Fang","description":"A Dew Spider's chelicera tied to the wrist with hardened web thread, always with a drop hanging at the tip that never falls. +11 power, +2 initiative.","flavor":"The drop weighs less than air. The fang doesn't."},
    "gh-gutter-shell": {"name":"Gutter Husk","description":"Half a copper greenhouse gutter bent like a shell over the chest, with a thousand years of green slime inside as lining. Rain runs down it as it always has. +32 HP, +12% Water, +5% Air.","flavor":"It has tended the water for a thousand years. It won't stop for you."},
    "gh-root-spur": {"name":"Lasher Spurs","description":"Two still-living pieces of Lasher tied to the heels: they pull the foot away from the blow and, when the wearer plants their heels, root whoever tries to flee. +11 dodge, +8 lock.","flavor":"Pruned from the bandstand, and still in a bad mood."},
    "ci-crab-claw": {"name":"Sinkhole Pincer","description":"The big pincer of the Sinkhole Crab, fitted to the forearm with wet leather straps. It closes once and opens by nobody's decision. +14 power, +10 lock.","flavor":"It dragged this thing along the ground. So will you."},
    "ci-silt-boots": {"name":"Silt Boots","description":"Short boots clogged with packed mud until they became ballast: they slip out of the blow, then sink in place, dragging along anyone stuck close. +8 dodge, +8 lock.","flavor":"The drain clogs from the bottom up. Learn from it."},
    "ci-crust-carapace": {"name":"Crust Carapace","description":"The whole crab's back, with the crust of salt and stone it spent a life gathering still stuck to the edges. Weighs like a table. +32 HP, +12% Earth, +6% Water.","flavor":"Each layer is a year nobody managed to pull it out of the drain."},
    "ci-sump-lamp": {"name":"Sinkhole Lamp","description":"A brass lamp stuck in the drain grate for decades, its flame muddied green and the glass scratched inside. Where its light hits the floor, the mud obeys. Grants the spell Mud Grab.","flavor":"Lit underwater, and no drowned soul found that strange."},
    "ci-piper-fang": {"name":"Flute Moray Fang","description":"The lower jaw of a Flute Moray, teeth turned inward and a flute hole on each side that whistles low when the arm comes down. +18 power, +6 initiative.","flavor":"The whistle arrives first. It's all she gives you."},
    "ci-pearl-mail": {"name":"Mud Pearl Mail","description":"Thousands of calcified pearls from the cistern floor, pierced and sewn into mail. Each formed around a grain of the court's dirt. +24 HP, +10% Water resistance.","flavor":"Pretty from afar. Up close, it's a list of names."},
    "ci-bone-lamp": {"name":"Bone Lantern","description":"A cage of polished ribs with a lump of cold light hanging inside. Rapping the biggest bone with a knuckle makes the whole cistern answer. Grants the spell Bone Toll.","flavor":"The court was large. There's always someone left to answer."},
    "em-quench-fang": {"name":"Temper Fang","description":"The jaw of the Temper Hound, still dripping the condensed steam that formed it. Each bite hisses like a blade entering the pit. +14 power, +4 initiative.","flavor":"The Lock's water has teeth. Now they're yours."},
    "em-quench-treads": {"name":"Pit Soles","description":"Soles soaked in the tempering pits' water that never dries up: they tread the glowing grate without a hiss and leave a cold footprint behind. +13 dodge, +6 initiative.","flavor":"The ember steps back. Always the same step."},
    "em-quench-vest": {"name":"Steam Breastplate","description":"Two plates with a finger of water trapped between them, turning to steam when the heat tightens and thickening the defense exactly when it's needed. +36 HP, +12% Water, +8% Fire.","flavor":"It hisses before you feel it. Warning included."},
    "em-quench-lamp": {"name":"Temper Lamp","description":"A thick glass lamp filled to the brim with pit water, lit from within by a cold blue that comes from no flame. Tilting it spills. Grants the spell Tempering Hiss.","flavor":"The only lit thing here that isn't fire."},
    "em-imp-gauntlet": {"name":"Brand Gauntlet","description":"A whole Brand hardened in a sand mold and hollowed out to fit a hand. Still hot, still in a bad mood. +15 power, +6% Fire resistance.","flavor":"Magno made these without looking. One survived whole."},
    "em-cinder-plate": {"name":"Living Slag Plate","description":"A slag plate torn from the Heap before it cooled, orange veins still running inside the gray. Warms the wearer's back all night. +28 HP, +14% Fire resistance.","flavor":"Cools in a thousand years. Nine hundred to go."},
    "em-hauler-links": {"name":"Dragging Chains","description":"Three links from the Chain Puller's spool dragged behind the heels: they give counterweight to spin out of the blow and snag the ankle of anyone trying to break free. +11 dodge, +12 lock.","flavor":"It never chased anyone. It brought everyone to it."},
    "av-noose-grip": {"name":"Blind Knot Fist","description":"A fist-sized knot of work rope, tar-hardened and impossible to undo, with half a fathom of cord left over for noosing. +16 power, +10 lock.","flavor":"Nobody undid this knot. Nobody will."},
    "av-hemp-boots": {"name":"Hemp Boots","description":"Boots with soles wrapped in braided hemp that bites wet planks and keeps the foot from slipping into the gap. +10 dodge, +8 initiative.","flavor":"On the Scaffolds, the difference between walking and falling is friction."},
    "av-knot-jerkin": {"name":"Knot Jerkin","description":"A jerkin woven entirely of overlapping sailor's knots, so tight the wind finds no slack to lift. +40 HP, +14% Neutral, +5% Air.","flavor":"Every knot has a name. This one has forty."},
    "av-hangman-lamp": {"name":"Pulley Lantern","description":"A signalman's lantern hung on a pulley hook, a spool of cable wound at the base and the flame always facing the gap. Pulling the cable brings back what the noose caught. Grants the spell Pulley Noose.","flavor":"It's for hoisting material. You are material."},
    "av-shrike-talon": {"name":"Shrike Claw","description":"The claw of a Plank Shrike worn as a knuckle-duster, the little bones it impaled on nails still dangling by a thread. +18 initiative, +8 power.","flavor":"Its nest was a showcase. You took one piece."},
    "av-serpent-sash": {"name":"Cask Wyrm Sash","description":"A Cask Wyrm's ribbon tail wound twice around the chest, ground glass still stuck to the wax. Rises with the current and lifts the body half a hand along. +34 HP, +16% Air resistance.","flavor":"A kite that learned to pull its own string. You hold the string now."},
    "av-ballast-greaves": {"name":"Ballast Greaves","description":"Two gravel sacks from the Ballast Golem tied to the shins: they give inertia to dodge without leaving the plank and anchor weight against anyone who wants past. +11 dodge, +12 lock.","flavor":"Held the scaffold for a thousand years. Now it holds you, and whoever comes near."},
    "mt-firedamp-fist": {"name":"Firedamp Fist","description":"A leather pouch full of the gallery's blue gas, sewn around the hand and sealed with pitch. Each punch belches a little flame through the seams. +20 power, +6 initiative.","flavor":"It leaks a little. It always leaks a little."},
    "mt-wisp-treads": {"name":"Blaze Soles","description":"Soles that float a finger above the gravel, the way the Firedamp Blaze floats at chest height. Silent, and they don't trigger traps. +13 dodge, +7 initiative.","flavor":"No dust rises. That's how the mine knows you've arrived."},
    "mt-damp-mantle": {"name":"Blue Flame Mantle","description":"A miner's canvas cloak with a film of lit gas running over the fabric, blue and without heat. What comes hot meets fire before it meets cloth. +44 HP, +16% Fire, +6% Earth.","flavor":"Cold to the touch. A good lie."},
    "mt-firedamp-lamp": {"name":"Safety Lamp","description":"The wire-mesh lamp that warned the miner of firedamp: the flame grows and turns blue when the gas arrives. The mesh opens, and that's why you took it. Grants the spell Firedamp Burst.","flavor":"Invented to save lives. Depends on which side of the mesh."},
    "mt-blast-knuckles": {"name":"Blast Knuckles","description":"Four damp dynamite capsules set in an iron bar, one per finger. None has gone off yet; all heard the invitation. +21 power, +8% Fire resistance.","flavor":"The box said \"damp\". The box lied about a lot of things."},
    "mt-seep-plate": {"name":"Runoff Breastplate","description":"A plate of mineral deposited layer by layer by water seeping up the wall, smooth on one side and rough on the other. A shield the mine made all by itself. +42 HP, +14% Water, +6% Earth.","flavor":"Mine water doesn't quench thirst. It serves another purpose."},
    "mt-grisu-wick": {"name":"Firedamp Wick","description":"A coil of mine fuse soaked in blue gas, one end always lit in a flame the size of a fingernail. Burns slowly and doesn't go out in wind. +7 power. Grants the spell Long Fuse.","flavor":"Lights at one corner of the gallery and collects at the other."},
    "cp-gale-fist": {"name":"Gale Gauntlet","description":"The Gale Herald's empty gauntlet, kept hand-shaped only by the wind still running through it. Closes by itself a moment before the blow. +18 power, +11 initiative.","flavor":"There's nothing inside. It still hurts."},
    "cp-gale-steps": {"name":"Gale Greaves","description":"Two hollow greaves from the same armor, wind entering at the knee and leaving at the heel with each stride. They arrive where they aimed, not where the enemy expected. +12 dodge, +12 initiative.","flavor":"Hard to pin down, worse to hit. It was his motto."},
    "cp-gale-plate": {"name":"Hollow Cuirass","description":"The Herald's armor torso, no lining, no owner, no weight: inside it's just a draft turning. The blow enters and finds nothing to hit. +48 HP, +16% Air, +6% Neutral.","flavor":"Truly empty. Check by hitting it: it rings like a bell."},
    "cp-gale-lamp": {"name":"Gale Beacon","description":"The Herald's helm turned mouth-up and used as a beacon, its wind trapped inside pushing a white flame sideways. Releasing the wind cuts in a straight line. Grants the spell Herald's Cut.","flavor":"The flame never stands upright. It never goes out either."},
    "cp-herald-ember": {"name":"Ember Herald Gauntlet","description":"The gauntlet from the Heart's ember chamber, filled to the wrist with coal that never finishes burning. Brands the wearer's palm on the first day, and never again. +21 power, +10% Fire resistance.","flavor":"The brand is the contract. You already signed."},
    "cp-ember-censer": {"name":"Ember Censer","description":"A short-chained censer with a shard of the ember chamber lodged in the bottom, lit and giving off red smoke. Swung a full turn, it drops a ring of fire on the ground. +11 power. Grants the spell Ember Trail.","flavor":"Someone prayed with this. They never finished the prayer."},
    "cp-tide-anklets": {"name":"Tide Anklets","description":"Two rings filled with the Tide Herald's dark water, always moving inside the metal. They pull the foot the right way a beat before the blow lands. +13 dodge, +10 initiative.","flavor":"The water decides first. You just don't disagree."},
    "cp-herald-stone": {"name":"Stone Herald Cuirass","description":"The Stone Herald's torso, torn out whole and still standing: a block from the Heart's stone chamber with pale veins running through, hollow to the exact size of a human chest. Weighs as if it were sinking. +50 HP, +16% Earth, +6% Neutral.","flavor":"The herald didn't fall when it died. It had to be pushed."},
    "sl-cetro": {"name":"Pale Blade","description":"A longsword of pearly white steel, a thread of golden light running down the center and a guard of golden wings. Weighs exactly what the hand needs it to.","flavor":"It has collected debts from things bigger than you."},
    "sl-botas": {"name":"Ivory Greaves","description":"White steel plates with filigree gold kneepads and soles lined with coins out of circulation. The wearer arrives before the price goes up.","flavor":"The first step is always profit."},
    "sl-cofre": {"name":"White Knight Cuirass","description":"A pearly white steel breastplate with golden winged pauldrons and the crest of the five flames on the chest. Inside it's still a vault: the lock works and nobody ever found the key.","flavor":"What it guards now is you."},
    "sl-selo-primeiro": {"name":"First Seal","description":"A solid gold medallion studded with white crystals, a halo slowly spinning. It's the coin that paid the first debt of the buried world: no heads or tails, just the five elements, one on each edge, and silence in the middle.","flavor":"Every coin descends. This one descended first."}
  },
  "sets": {
    "gh-set-flora": {"name":"Voracious Flora Garb","description":"Torn piece by piece from plants that learned to hunt in the dark. The wearer takes root where they decide to stay."},
    "gh-set-dew": {"name":"Leak Garb","description":"The greenhouse has rained indoors for a thousand years. What lives in the gutters is made of standing water, and slips through the fingers of anyone trying to hold it."},
    "ci-set-drowned": {"name":"Drowned Court Garb","description":"The ballroom clothes of the court the cistern drank. They still drip, still weigh, still know how to dance."},
    "ci-set-brine": {"name":"Salt and Bone Garb","description":"Crystallized salt, polished bone and jellyfish light: the creatures that dropped these pieces had no element at all, only patience."},
    "em-set-forge": {"name":"Furnace Brood Garb","description":"Made from what the world's first flame spat out. It doesn't protect from fire: it convinces fire you're family."},
    "em-set-slag": {"name":"Slag Garb","description":"Cold iron, slag and chain: the forge's scrap, hardened by a thousand years of nothing happening. Weighs like a final argument."},
    "av-set-gale": {"name":"Gale Garb","description":"Everything living in the open gaps is made of haste. These pieces sing in the current and arrive half a step before the wearer."},
    "av-set-rigging": {"name":"Rigging Garb","description":"Plank, rope and wire: what's left of those who built the walkways and kept walking on them after death."},
    "mt-set-bedrock": {"name":"Bedrock Garb","description":"Carved from the mountain's bone by the things living beneath it. While the mine trembles, this does not."},
    "mt-set-tools": {"name":"Miner Garb","description":"Drill, wheel, slate and nail: tools of people, with no element at all. It kept working long after we stopped."},
    "cp-set-heart": {"name":"Heart Garb","description":"The four legendary pieces of the last Lock, mounted on a shard of the Great Lousa itself. They drop only from the Broken Heart, and rarely: completing this is the end of the game, and the start of the real game."},
    "cp-set-cinder": {"name":"Broken Ember Garb","description":"The half of the Heart that still burns. It warms nothing: it just wants to finish what it was doing when it cracked."},
    "gh-set-swarm": {"name":"Swarm Garb","description":"Chitin, pollen and three wasps trapped in a honeycomb. What buzzes in the greenhouse doesn't fight: it arrives first, settles it and vanishes before the plant notices it lost someone."},
    "ci-set-sump": {"name":"Sinkhole Garb","description":"Stone, salt and packed mud: what piled up in the drain where the cistern empties. It doesn't float, doesn't dodge and doesn't leave the spot it chose."},
    "em-set-quench": {"name":"Tempering Garb","description":"The Lock's only water, worn as clothing. Made to quench glowing blades, and it hasn't unlearned: where this garb passes, the house's fire steps back and watches."},
    "av-set-noose": {"name":"Hangman Garb","description":"Rope, knot and pulley: the work material that outlived the workers. It has no element, so the gale neither helps nor hinders, and on the Scaffolds that's a whole advantage."},
    "mt-set-firedamp": {"name":"Firedamp Garb","description":"The blue gas the night shift learned to fear, sewn into clothing. In a whole mine of stone and patience, it's the only thing that settles things fast, and it settles for both sides."},
    "cp-set-gale": {"name":"Broken Gale Garb","description":"The Heart's air chamber, taken apart piece by piece from the Herald that guarded it. Inside it's hollow: the wearer walks half a step ahead of their own body and arrives before being expected."},
    "sl-set-colecionador": {"name":"Collector Garb","description":"Paid in seals, one spin at a time, to the only NPC who doesn't haggle. Whoever completes all four pieces walks with a white fire that burns nothing, only remembers."}
  },
  "stones": {
    "stone-ember": {"name":"Clotted Ember","description":"A drop of fire that cooled outside and gave up cooling inside. Lukewarm in the hand, hotter near the anvil."},
    "stone-tear": {"name":"Cistern Tear","description":"A drop of still water that hardened without becoming ice. A little wave is still trapped inside, slowly turning."},
    "stone-root": {"name":"Bedrock Grain","description":"A stone seed from the mine's depths, pale veins running inside like roots. Heavier than it should be."},
    "stone-breath": {"name":"Bottled Breath","description":"A bubble of wind compressed into mineral. Whistles softly when someone runs past."},
    "stone-slate": {"name":"Lousa Shard","description":"A shard of the sky turned to stone. It has no element because it's all of them at once: fits any forge."},
    "stone-anchor": {"name":"Forge Anchor","description":"A whole anvil tooth pulled out, heavy as guilt. Bound to the piece during the strike, it keeps the level from slipping back. Only the deepest bosses carry one."}
  },
  "consumiveis": {
    "pocao-pequena": {"name":"Small Health Potion","description":"A swallow of red syrup. Heals 30 HP for the drinker."},
    "pocao-media": {"name":"Medium Health Potion","description":"The merchant's best-selling vial. Heals 70 HP for the drinker."},
    "pocao-grande": {"name":"Large Health Potion","description":"A bulbous bottle for the boss room. Heals 150 HP for the drinker."}
  },
  "eco": {
    "golpes/fogo": {"nome":"Core Rain"},
    "golpes/agua": {"nome":"Deep Tide"},
    "golpes/terra": {"nome":"Fissure"},
    "golpes/ar": {"nome":"Broken Currents"}
  }
} });
